<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.300" end="00:00:04.300" style="s2">Hey, please help me. I don&#39;t know how to</p>
<p begin="00:00:02.200" end="00:00:04.900" style="s2">use this thing. My stomach is worrying</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.300" end="00:00:07.000" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.900" end="00:00:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come down. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.000" end="00:00:10.000" style="s2">Look, Kukua,</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.400" end="00:00:12.500" style="s2">you don&#39;t [snorts] climb on it. You sit</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.000" end="00:00:15.800" style="s2">here like this. When you finish, close</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.500" end="00:00:15.800" style="s2">the lid and press this button.</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.200" end="00:00:20.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot, what is happening?</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.000" end="00:00:22.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. It&#39;s only flashing.</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.305" end="00:00:22.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.100" end="00:00:26.900" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve made my feelings clear. I&#39;d like to</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.300" end="00:00:29.000" style="s2">build a life with you.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.900" end="00:00:30.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.000" end="00:00:30.785" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wouldn&#39;t have to worry about</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.000" end="00:00:32.805" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:00:30.785" end="00:00:32.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.200" end="00:00:40.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot, my brother,</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.900" end="00:00:42.300" style="s2">I don&#39;t understand you. We came here for</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.600" end="00:00:43.600" style="s2">an engagement, but you&#39;ve been looking</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.300" end="00:00:45.000" style="s2">around as though you&#39;re searching for</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.600" end="00:00:47.100" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.000" end="00:00:49.200" style="s2">Maybe he&#39;s looking for a village wife.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.100" end="00:00:50.300" style="s2">Elliot, Elliot, should we start asking</p>
<p begin="00:00:49.200" end="00:00:52.100" style="s2">around?</p>
<p begin="00:00:50.300" end="00:00:53.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You people never stop talking. Let me</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.100" end="00:00:55.000" style="s2">breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.200" end="00:00:56.300" style="s2">Then tell us, what exactly are you</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.000" end="00:00:57.800" style="s2">looking at?</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.300" end="00:01:00.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That lady over there,</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.800" end="00:01:00.600" style="s2">do any of you know her?</p>
<p begin="00:01:03.100" end="00:01:06.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which lady? There are people everywhere,</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.100" end="00:01:08.200" style="s2">my friend.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.000" end="00:01:09.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The tall one helping the women.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.200" end="00:01:11.700" style="s2">Look carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.700" end="00:01:12.300" style="s2">She hasn&#39;t rested since we arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.700" end="00:01:15.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, my</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.300" end="00:01:16.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot, please tell me you&#39;re joking.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.700" end="00:01:18.300" style="s2">Ah,</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.500" end="00:01:18.700" style="s2">this man has lost his mind.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.300" end="00:01:19.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Amen.</p>
<p begin="00:01:18.700" end="00:01:21.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is funny?</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.800" end="00:01:23.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please enjoy your food.</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.600" end="00:01:24.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at the women sitting under this</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.100" end="00:01:27.300" style="s2">canopy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.500" end="00:01:28.600" style="s2">Beautiful women everywhere. Some even</p>
<p begin="00:01:27.300" end="00:01:30.000" style="s2">came from Accra.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.600" end="00:01:30.700" style="s2">And you&#39;re looking at somebody carrying</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.000" end="00:01:31.800" style="s2">buckets.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.700" end="00:01:33.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elvis,</p>
<p begin="00:01:31.800" end="00:01:35.200" style="s2">what does carrying a bucket have to do</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.400" end="00:01:36.941" style="s2">with anything?</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.200" end="00:01:38.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s working honestly.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.941" end="00:01:40.800" style="s2">[music] Why should that make her beneath</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.300" end="00:01:43.700" style="s2">your notice? My friend, look at her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.800" end="00:01:46.500" style="s2">Worn slippers, carrying buckets while</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.700" end="00:01:48.800" style="s2">everyone else enjoys the ceremony.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.500" end="00:01:50.500" style="s2">You see how worn slippers</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.800" end="00:01:52.400" style="s2">I see somebody who has been working</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.500" end="00:01:54.600" style="s2">since we arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.400" end="00:01:55.500" style="s2">And what exactly does that mean? Look at</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.600" end="00:01:57.800" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.500" end="00:01:59.700" style="s2">Everyone is enjoying the ceremony. She&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.800" end="00:02:00.992" style="s2">been fetching water, sweeping, and</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.700" end="00:02:02.892" style="s2">serving</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.992" end="00:02:03.592" style="s2">Yet nobody has even asked whether she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.892" end="00:02:06.592" style="s2">eating.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.592" end="00:02:08.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukua, where are the extra plates? Must</p>
<p begin="00:02:06.592" end="00:02:11.192" style="s2">I call you 10 times? Wash this before</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.992" end="00:02:12.492" style="s2">the next guests arrive. We cannot keep</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.192" end="00:02:14.292" style="s2">them waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:02:12.492" end="00:02:17.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, madam. I&#39;ll carry them</p>
<p begin="00:02:14.292" end="00:02:20.292" style="s2">carefully and start now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.592" end="00:02:21.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you hear how she spoke to her?</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.292" end="00:02:24.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hear what?</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.892" end="00:02:26.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s been working since morning.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.192" end="00:02:28.492" style="s2">Does nobody notice that she&#39;s tired?</p>
<p begin="00:02:26.392" end="00:02:30.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot, please. Don&#39;t tell me you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.492" end="00:02:31.961" style="s2">planning to rescue every hard-working</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.492" end="00:02:32.092" style="s2">woman in Ghana.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.961" end="00:02:33.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.092" end="00:02:34.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.192" end="00:02:37.192" style="s2">But I&#39;d like to know who she is.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.792" end="00:02:40.992" style="s2">Sometimes I wonder how a man who owns</p>
<p begin="00:02:37.192" end="00:02:43.092" style="s2">skyscrapers can think like this.</p>
<p begin="00:02:40.992" end="00:02:43.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came to celebrate, Elliot. Now you</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.092" end="00:02:46.892" style="s2">look troubled.</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.892" end="00:02:48.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe that&#39;s why I own them, Elvis.</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.892" end="00:02:52.192" style="s2">I learned to see possibilities where</p>
<p begin="00:02:48.892" end="00:02:52.192" style="s2">other people see nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.592" end="00:02:59.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please sit.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.192" end="00:03:00.392" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to stand because I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.492" end="00:03:02.292" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.392" end="00:03:04.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, sir. I thought maybe you needed</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.292" end="00:03:06.292" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.692" end="00:03:07.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, I wanted to ask whether you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.292" end="00:03:08.392" style="s2">eaten.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.292" end="00:03:09.892" style="s2">You look tired.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.392" end="00:03:11.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll eat when we finish serving the</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.892" end="00:03:13.992" style="s2">guests, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.192" end="00:03:13.992" style="s2">We&#39;re still busy.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.392" end="00:03:17.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the guests have been eating for</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.792" end="00:03:19.492" style="s2">hours.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.592" end="00:03:23.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s how it works, sir. We serve them</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.492" end="00:03:23.992" style="s2">first. If food remains, we also eat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.492" end="00:03:27.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.492" end="00:03:29.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukua, sir. Kukua Asante.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.792" end="00:03:31.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.392" end="00:03:33.692" style="s2">Please, you can call me Elliot. There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.292" end="00:03:36.092" style="s2">no need to be nervous.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.692" end="00:03:37.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, no, sir. I can&#39;t call you that.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.092" end="00:03:38.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why not?</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.092" end="00:03:41.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re one of the important guests. I</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.792" end="00:03:42.692" style="s2">don&#39;t want to seem disrespectful.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.192" end="00:03:45.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukua,</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.692" end="00:03:47.292" style="s2">being invited to sit under a canopy</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.192" end="00:03:50.892" style="s2">doesn&#39;t make me more important</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.292" end="00:03:50.892" style="s2">than the person who helped arrange it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.392" end="00:03:53.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.292" end="00:03:58.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukua,</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.692" end="00:04:01.092" style="s2">are you coming or not?</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.192" end="00:04:02.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, sir. I have to go.</p>
<p begin="00:04:01.092" end="00:04:03.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.292" end="00:04:04.994" style="s2">It was nice meeting you,</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.894" end="00:04:07.194" style="s2">I won&#39;t keep you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:04.994" end="00:04:10.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, sir. Thank you for asking</p>
<p begin="00:04:07.194" end="00:04:10.294" style="s2">whether I had eaten.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.394" end="00:04:16.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So,</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.394" end="00:04:18.894" style="s2">have you finished interviewing your</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.494" end="00:04:20.194" style="s2">future wife? Elvis, leave the girl</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.894" end="00:04:21.594" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.194" end="00:04:24.294" style="s2">You see?</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.594" end="00:04:26.494" style="s2">You&#39;re already defending her.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.294" end="00:04:28.094" style="s2">I&#39;m going to speak with my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.494" end="00:04:29.394" style="s2">About what? You&#39;ve suddenly become</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.094" end="00:04:30.394" style="s2">serious.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.394" end="00:04:31.794" style="s2">Kukua,</p>
<p begin="00:04:30.394" end="00:04:32.894" style="s2">I want to understand what her life is</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.794" end="00:04:34.894" style="s2">like.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.894" end="00:04:36.294" style="s2">This engagement has turned into another</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.894" end="00:04:38.194" style="s2">engagement.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.294" end="00:04:41.794" style="s2">Elliot, at least tell me when to start</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.194" end="00:04:41.794" style="s2">practicing my best man speech.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.294" end="00:04:47.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son,</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.494" end="00:04:48.794" style="s2">I thought you were still enjoying the</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.794" end="00:04:50.794" style="s2">ceremony.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.794" end="00:04:51.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, there&#39;s something I want to ask</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.794" end="00:04:54.894" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.694" end="00:04:56.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sit down. What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.894" end="00:04:58.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, do you know a young woman called</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.694" end="00:05:01.394" style="s2">Kukua Asante?</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.494" end="00:05:03.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukua, Grace&#39;s daughter? Yes, my son.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.394" end="00:05:04.594" style="s2">What has brought her to your mind?</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.094" end="00:05:07.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know her mother.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.594" end="00:05:08.594" style="s2">She&#39;s tall, very dark, with beautiful</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.894" end="00:05:11.594" style="s2">eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.594" end="00:05:13.748" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, that&#39;s Kukua. Why are you asking?</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.594" end="00:05:15.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watched her working today.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.748" end="00:05:17.694" style="s2">[music] She looks exhausted, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.994" end="00:05:19.994" style="s2">Does she always do this kind of work?</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.694" end="00:05:22.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You remember Grace, my friend who used</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.994" end="00:05:23.494" style="s2">to sell provisions near the old market?</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.294" end="00:05:25.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.494" end="00:05:26.794" style="s2">Her husband was a teacher, wasn&#39;t he?</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.694" end="00:05:29.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mm.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.794" end="00:05:31.894" style="s2">He was a hard-working teacher. He loved</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.194" end="00:05:34.394" style="s2">that daughter of his, Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.894" end="00:05:36.894" style="s2">Whenever he spoke about her future, his</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.394" end="00:05:38.694" style="s2">whole face changed. When Kukua completed</p>
<p begin="00:05:36.894" end="00:05:40.594" style="s2">secondary school, her father was so</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.694" end="00:05:42.594" style="s2">proud. He kept telling everybody she</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.594" end="00:05:44.094" style="s2">would become something great.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.594" end="00:05:46.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So why didn&#39;t she continue her</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.094" end="00:05:48.694" style="s2">education?</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.094" end="00:05:50.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He died, Elliot, just a few days after</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.694" end="00:05:51.894" style="s2">her examination results came.</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.794" end="00:05:53.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.894" end="00:05:55.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grace couldn&#39;t even finish grieving</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.494" end="00:05:58.594" style="s2">before people started demanding money.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.494" end="00:06:00.394" style="s2">Funeral expenses, debts, school fees,</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.594" end="00:06:01.794" style="s2">everything came at once.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.394" end="00:06:03.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Kukua, Mama,</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.794" end="00:06:04.194" style="s2">what happened to her dreams after all</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.294" end="00:06:05.595" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.194" end="00:06:07.795" style="s2">She finished school.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.595" end="00:06:09.495" style="s2">Surely, she wanted more than simply</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.795" end="00:06:11.595" style="s2">getting through tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.495" end="00:06:13.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She put her dreams aside.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.595" end="00:06:15.895" style="s2">Weddings, funerals, chop bars, fetching</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.895" end="00:06:17.895" style="s2">water, whatever honest work she could</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.895" end="00:06:19.295" style="s2">find. That is how she helps her mother</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.895" end="00:06:22.395" style="s2">survive.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.295" end="00:06:25.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; she still want to go to school?</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.395" end="00:06:27.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every time I ask, she smiles and says,</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.295" end="00:06:29.895" style="s2">Mama Margaret, maybe one day.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.795" end="00:06:30.995" style="s2">Elliot, why are you so interested in</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.895" end="00:06:33.495" style="s2">this girl?</p>
<p begin="00:06:30.995" end="00:06:36.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, I want to help her.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.495" end="00:06:36.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help her how?</p>
<p begin="00:06:37.095" end="00:06:40.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want her to come to Accra, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.195" end="00:06:42.295" style="s2">If she agrees, I&#39;ll support her</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.995" end="00:06:43.995" style="s2">education.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.295" end="00:06:46.595" style="s2">Let her have a real chance to learn.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.995" end="00:06:47.895" style="s2">I&#39;ll help her learn new skills and build</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.595" end="00:06:49.895" style="s2">a future.</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.895" end="00:06:51.595" style="s2">She should have choices, Mama,</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.895" end="00:06:52.095" style="s2">instead of wondering whether food will</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.595" end="00:06:54.195" style="s2">remain.</p>
<p begin="00:06:52.095" end="00:06:56.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son, taking responsibility for</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.195" end="00:06:56.895" style="s2">another person&#39;s future is not a small</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.195" end="00:06:58.595" style="s2">thing.</p>
<p begin="00:06:56.895" end="00:07:00.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.595" end="00:07:02.895" style="s2">This must be more than today&#39;s sympathy.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.595" end="00:07:04.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s young. She has never lived in</p>
<p begin="00:07:02.895" end="00:07:05.995" style="s2">Accra.</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.195" end="00:07:07.095" style="s2">A different world can be overwhelming,</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.995" end="00:07:08.595" style="s2">Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.095" end="00:07:10.695" style="s2">You must remember how unfamiliar</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.595" end="00:07:13.295" style="s2">everything will feel and consider how</p>
<p begin="00:07:10.695" end="00:07:15.595" style="s2">people will interpret your intentions.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.295" end="00:07:17.395" style="s2">A wealthy man helping a young woman will</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.595" end="00:07:19.895" style="s2">raise questions.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.395" end="00:07:22.195" style="s2">You must answer them honestly.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.895" end="00:07:24.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s make my intentions clear from</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.195" end="00:07:25.595" style="s2">the beginning.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.095" end="00:07:26.795" style="s2">I am not asking for her hand in</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.595" end="00:07:28.495" style="s2">marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.795" end="00:07:30.495" style="s2">I want to support her education.</p>
<p begin="00:07:28.495" end="00:07:32.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure, Elliot?</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.495" end="00:07:33.995" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.395" end="00:07:35.395" style="s2">I need to know you understand what</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.995" end="00:07:37.895" style="s2">you&#39;re promising</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.395" end="00:07:40.395" style="s2">before I speak to her mother.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.895" end="00:07:42.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, you raised me to believe that</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.395" end="00:07:44.895" style="s2">having money means nothing</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.695" end="00:07:46.395" style="s2">if I cannot use some of it to improve</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.895" end="00:07:47.895" style="s2">somebody&#39;s life.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.395" end="00:07:51.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father used to say something like</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.895" end="00:07:53.695" style="s2">that. You sound like him today.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.595" end="00:07:54.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then perhaps I learned it from both of</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.695" end="00:07:56.695" style="s2">you, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:07:54.395" end="00:07:58.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grace is my friend.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.695" end="00:08:01.795" style="s2">I can speak with her,</p>
<p begin="00:07:58.895" end="00:08:04.295" style="s2">but Kukua must make her own decision.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.795" end="00:08:07.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s exactly what I want.</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.295" end="00:08:11.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And where will you stay tonight, my son?</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.195" end="00:08:13.197" style="s2">Grace and Kukua will need time to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.097" end="00:08:14.897" style="s2">This is a big decision for them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.197" end="00:08:16.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll book a hotel room,</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.897" end="00:08:19.197" style="s2">talk to them privately.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.897" end="00:08:20.697" style="s2">I don&#39;t want them to feel pressured</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.197" end="00:08:21.497" style="s2">because I&#39;m sitting there waiting for an</p>
<p begin="00:08:20.697" end="00:08:24.597" style="s2">answer.</p>
<p begin="00:08:21.497" end="00:08:27.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son, if you begin this journey,</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.597" end="00:08:28.497" style="s2">be patient with that girl. She has known</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.097" end="00:08:30.097" style="s2">a very different life.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.497" end="00:08:32.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.097" end="00:08:33.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Margaret, you frightened me. You said</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.397" end="00:08:36.697" style="s2">there was something important to</p>
<p begin="00:08:33.697" end="00:08:38.697" style="s2">discuss. Don&#39;t be frightened, my friend.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.697" end="00:08:41.597" style="s2">Elliot met Kukua at the engagement</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.697" end="00:08:43.797" style="s2">today. Did she do something wrong? No,</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.597" end="00:08:45.897" style="s2">nothing like that. He was impressed by</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.797" end="00:08:48.897" style="s2">her. He wants to help her continue her</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.897" end="00:08:51.897" style="s2">education in Accra. Accra? So far from</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.897" end="00:08:53.597" style="s2">everything she knows? Yes, Grace.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.897" end="00:08:55.397" style="s2">And where would she live?</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.597" end="00:08:57.697" style="s2">I need to understand before I can even</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.397" end="00:08:59.797" style="s2">think. Elliot says he can arrange</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.697" end="00:09:02.297" style="s2">accommodation and take responsibility</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.797" end="00:09:03.897" style="s2">for the expenses while she finds her</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.297" end="00:09:05.897" style="s2">feet.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.897" end="00:09:07.797" style="s2">Margaret, you know what happened after</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.897" end="00:09:09.697" style="s2">my husband died?</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.797" end="00:09:12.797" style="s2">We&#39;ve only had each other.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.697" end="00:09:15.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, Grace. That is why we must talk.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.797" end="00:09:17.897" style="s2">That girl is all I have. Some nights she</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.397" end="00:09:19.997" style="s2">comes home with aching feet</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.897" end="00:09:21.597" style="s2">and still asks me whether I&#39;ve eaten.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.997" end="00:09:24.197" style="s2">She pretends she&#39;s strong because she</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.597" end="00:09:26.497" style="s2">doesn&#39;t want me to worry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:24.197" end="00:09:28.897" style="s2">But I&#39;m her mother, Margaret.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.497" end="00:09:31.497" style="s2">I can hear the tiredness in her voice.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.897" end="00:09:33.897" style="s2">If something happens to her in Accra,</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.497" end="00:09:36.597" style="s2">what will I tell her father&#39;s grave?</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.897" end="00:09:37.397" style="s2">Margaret, how do I let my only daughter</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.597" end="00:09:39.297" style="s2">go?</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.397" end="00:09:41.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I cannot promise that life will never</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.297" end="00:09:43.297" style="s2">disappoint her,</p>
<p begin="00:09:41.197" end="00:09:45.897" style="s2">but I know my son</p>
<p begin="00:09:43.297" end="00:09:48.297" style="s2">and I believe his intentions are good.</p>
<p begin="00:09:45.897" end="00:09:50.397" style="s2">Why would a wealthy man do all this for</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.297" end="00:09:51.297" style="s2">somebody he barely knows?</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.397" end="00:09:53.497" style="s2">Hm?</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.297" end="00:09:55.297" style="s2">Forgive me, Margaret, but I have to ask</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.497" end="00:09:56.397" style="s2">these questions. That is a fair</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.297" end="00:09:58.197" style="s2">question.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.397" end="00:10:01.097" style="s2">Ask Elliot yourself before deciding</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.197" end="00:10:03.897" style="s2">anything. You are her mother, Grace.</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.097" end="00:10:05.897" style="s2">You deserve a clear answer from him.</p>
<p begin="00:10:03.897" end="00:10:07.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, you called me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.897" end="00:10:10.798" style="s2">Is everything all right?</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.697" end="00:10:12.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my daughter. Come and sit with us.</p>
<p begin="00:10:10.798" end="00:10:15.298" style="s2">There is something we need to discuss.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.898" end="00:10:16.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, is something wrong? You&#39;re both so</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.298" end="00:10:18.598" style="s2">quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:10:16.598" end="00:10:20.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, my daughter. Mama Margaret has</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.598" end="00:10:23.098" style="s2">brought us an unexpected opportunity.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.998" end="00:10:26.198" style="s2">Listen to her first. Elliot wants to</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.098" end="00:10:28.098" style="s2">support your education in Accra.</p>
<p begin="00:10:26.198" end="00:10:31.998" style="s2">He can arrange accommodation and cover</p>
<p begin="00:10:28.098" end="00:10:34.798" style="s2">the expenses while you find your feet.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.998" end="00:10:36.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Accra? Me? Mama Margaret, are you really</p>
<p begin="00:10:34.798" end="00:10:37.898" style="s2">talking about me?</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.198" end="00:10:39.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.898" end="00:10:42.198" style="s2">But nobody is forcing you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.798" end="00:10:44.798" style="s2">This must be your choice.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.198" end="00:10:46.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, what will happen to you if I go?</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.798" end="00:10:48.698" style="s2">Who will be here with you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.598" end="00:10:49.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry about me, my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.698" end="00:10:52.298" style="s2">Listen first.</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.898" end="00:10:53.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can I not worry, Mama?</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.298" end="00:10:55.498" style="s2">Sometimes we don&#39;t even have enough</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.798" end="00:10:57.198" style="s2">money for food.</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.498" end="00:10:59.598" style="s2">How can I leave and pretend that doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.198" end="00:10:59.598" style="s2">matter?</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.698" end="00:11:04.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukua, listen carefully. Your father</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.698" end="00:11:06.898" style="s2">worked all his life because he wanted</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.598" end="00:11:08.398" style="s2">you to have opportunities he never had.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.898" end="00:11:10.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.398" end="00:11:11.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You cannot spend the rest of your life</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.098" end="00:11:14.098" style="s2">carrying buckets because you&#39;re afraid</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.798" end="00:11:18.198" style="s2">to leave me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.098" end="00:11:19.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But what if I go there and fail?</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.198" end="00:11:21.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you learn</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.998" end="00:11:23.998" style="s2">and try again.</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.998" end="00:11:28.398" style="s2">Accra is a city, my daughter, not</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.998" end="00:11:30.498" style="s2">heaven. People make mistakes there too.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.398" end="00:11:33.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama Margaret, I&#39;ve never even traveled</p>
<p begin="00:11:30.498" end="00:11:34.298" style="s2">that far before. Everything will be new.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.098" end="00:11:36.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.298" end="00:11:38.398" style="s2">then you&#39;ll have many things to learn</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.098" end="00:11:40.198" style="s2">one at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.398" end="00:11:42.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to try, Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.198" end="00:11:43.998" style="s2">I&#39;m frightened, but</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.198" end="00:11:45.698" style="s2">but I want to try.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.998" end="00:11:48.698" style="s2">I cannot keep saying one day for the</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.698" end="00:11:48.698" style="s2">rest of my life.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.698" end="00:12:02.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, Kukua.</p>
<p begin="00:11:59.598" end="00:12:04.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.098" end="00:12:05.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready for Accra?</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.098" end="00:12:06.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think so.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.498" end="00:12:08.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right to be nervous. We&#39;re not</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.898" end="00:12:10.898" style="s2">in a hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.898" end="00:12:12.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot, tell me plainly, what do you</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.898" end="00:12:12.799" style="s2">expect from my daughter?</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.498" end="00:12:14.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.799" end="00:12:16.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; in return, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.399" end="00:12:17.899" style="s2">This is support for her education.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.499" end="00:12:19.499" style="s2">Kukua,</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.899" end="00:12:20.599" style="s2">is this what you want?</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.499" end="00:12:22.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.599" end="00:12:26.199" style="s2">I want to continue school.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.499" end="00:12:26.199" style="s2">Mama and I have talked about it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.899" end="00:12:29.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot, please.</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.499" end="00:12:31.799" style="s2">I don&#39;t have money to reward you for</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.999" end="00:12:32.999" style="s2">what you&#39;re offering my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.799" end="00:12:34.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama Grace,</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.999" end="00:12:36.799" style="s2">I&#39;m not asking for a reward.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.999" end="00:12:39.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then promise me one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:12:36.799" end="00:12:41.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything reasonable, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:12:39.199" end="00:12:44.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make her feel small because she</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.099" end="00:12:44.599" style="s2">doesn&#39;t know the things you know.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.699" end="00:12:48.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise, mama Grace.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.599" end="00:12:51.199" style="s2">We all started somewhere. She will be</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.499" end="00:12:53.599" style="s2">free to ask questions and make mistakes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.199" end="00:12:56.399" style="s2">I will remember what you&#39;ve said.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.599" end="00:12:58.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, I&#39;ll call you when we arrive.</p>
<p begin="00:12:56.399" end="00:13:00.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You better call. Don&#39;t go and forget me</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.499" end="00:13:02.788" style="s2">because you have entered Accra.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.768" end="00:13:02.788" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.599" end="00:13:12.599" style="s2">My daughter,</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.799" end="00:13:14.699" style="s2">wherever life takes you,</p>
<p begin="00:13:12.599" end="00:13:15.999" style="s2">never forget the people who loved you</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.699" end="00:13:19.299" style="s2">when you had nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.999" end="00:13:19.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will never forget, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.699" end="00:13:23.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And don&#39;t think you have to become</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.099" end="00:13:26.299" style="s2">another person</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.199" end="00:13:28.399" style="s2">to make people accept you.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.299" end="00:13:30.499" style="s2">Learn everything you can.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.399" end="00:13:31.899" style="s2">Never be ashamed of where you came from,</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.499" end="00:13:33.699" style="s2">my daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.899" end="00:13:35.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:13:33.699" end="00:13:38.399" style="s2">Whatever I learn there, I will still be</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.899" end="00:13:41.399" style="s2">your Kukua.</p>
<p begin="00:13:38.399" end="00:13:44.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave me room to grow</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.399" end="00:13:47.999" style="s2">and watched me learn to fly.</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.399" end="00:13:50.299" style="s2">But hid the fallen pieces when I asked</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.999" end="00:13:52.399" style="s2">if you were fine.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.299" end="00:13:56.199" style="s2">While strangers called my name [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.399" end="00:13:56.199" style="s2">beneath [music] those shining lights.</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.399" end="00:13:58.899" style="s2">You carried all your sorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.299" end="00:14:00.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir?</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.899" end="00:14:02.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Kukua?</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.999" end="00:14:06.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, where is this cold wind coming</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.799" end="00:14:07.999" style="s2">from? All the windows are closed.</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.099" end="00:14:09.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the air conditioner.</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.999" end="00:14:10.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Air conditioner?</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.099" end="00:14:12.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.399" end="00:14:13.799" style="s2">It keeps the inside of the car cool.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.799" end="00:14:15.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey!</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.799" end="00:14:17.301" style="s2">So this car has its own harmattan and</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.801" end="00:14:18.701" style="s2">you carry it everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.301" end="00:14:21.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something like that. You&#39;ve found a</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.701" end="00:14:23.301" style="s2">better name for it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.501" end="00:14:24.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you can make it stop?</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.301" end="00:14:25.601" style="s2">Just like that?</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.401" end="00:14:27.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.601" end="00:14:28.901" style="s2">Watch this.</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.401" end="00:14:31.601" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to sit there shivering</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.901" end="00:14:31.601" style="s2">all the way.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.501" end="00:14:38.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, so you control the weather inside</p>
<p begin="00:14:37.601" end="00:14:40.501" style="s2">your car.</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.501" end="00:14:42.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only inside the car, Kukua. I haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.501" end="00:14:44.315" style="s2">become that powerful yet.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.295" end="00:14:44.315" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:14:48.190" end="00:14:52.175" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.155" end="00:14:52.175" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.775" end="00:14:54.795" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.050" end="00:14:58.070" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:14:58.701" end="00:15:02.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has that been an accident? Nobody is</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.601" end="00:15:03.601" style="s2">moving and that man is already far</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.701" end="00:15:06.601" style="s2">ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:15:03.601" end="00:15:08.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No accident, just traffic. Welcome to</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.601" end="00:15:11.601" style="s2">Accra.</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.701" end="00:15:13.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That man has overtaken us on his legs.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.601" end="00:15:15.001" style="s2">We left the village this morning to come</p>
<p begin="00:15:13.201" end="00:15:18.701" style="s2">and park here.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.001" end="00:15:18.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We will move eventually.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.630" end="00:15:21.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing and music]</p>
<p begin="00:15:24.215" end="00:15:26.235" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.901" end="00:15:33.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot, who owns this beautiful place?</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.101" end="00:15:34.501" style="s2">Are you sure we&#39;ve come to the right</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.501" end="00:15:36.501" style="s2">house?</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.501" end="00:15:37.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukua, this is my house.</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.501" end="00:15:39.201" style="s2">You&#39;re welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.701" end="00:15:41.301" style="s2">Make yourself comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:15:39.201" end="00:15:44.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your house? All this?</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.301" end="00:15:46.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Kukua. It&#39;s mine.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.601" end="00:15:48.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, where should I remove my</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.101" end="00:15:49.201" style="s2">sandals? Your floor is cleaner than our</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.201" end="00:15:50.421" style="s2">best table.</p>
<p begin="00:15:49.201" end="00:15:53.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wherever you&#39;re comfortable. There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.421" end="00:15:53.701" style="s2">[music] no inspection here.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.401" end="00:15:59.501" style="s2">This is your room. The key is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.201" end="00:16:00.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who else sleeps here? All this space for</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.501" end="00:16:03.701" style="s2">only me?</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.801" end="00:16:05.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody else. Take your time.</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.701" end="00:16:07.901" style="s2">This is your bathroom.</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.401" end="00:16:08.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bathroom is inside. At home, we go</p>
<p begin="00:16:07.901" end="00:16:10.501" style="s2">outside.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.801" end="00:16:12.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The plumbing carries everything away. It</p>
<p begin="00:16:10.501" end="00:16:14.401" style="s2">gives you privacy, especially at night</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.701" end="00:16:16.601" style="s2">or in rain.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.401" end="00:16:17.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, please excuse me. I want to ease</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.601" end="00:16:18.902" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.901" end="00:16:19.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:16:18.902" end="00:16:23.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; take your time. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.802" end="00:16:23.402" style="s2">Call me if anything is confusing.</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.096" end="00:16:29.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.716" end="00:16:31.736" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.301" end="00:16:36.321" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.802" end="00:16:43.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey God, how am I supposed to use this</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.302" end="00:16:43.702" style="s2">thing?</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.402" end="00:16:46.802" style="s2">Hey!</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.402" end="00:16:52.302" style="s2">What kind of toilet is this?</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.302" end="00:16:54.202" style="s2">Oh God, please help me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.302" end="00:16:56.402" style="s2">What should I do now?</p>
<p begin="00:16:54.202" end="00:16:59.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, I want the one outside like my</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.402" end="00:17:00.502" style="s2">village. I don&#39;t know whether to climb.</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.102" end="00:17:03.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t climb. Let me show you</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.502" end="00:17:03.176" style="s2">properly. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.402" end="00:17:08.602" style="s2">Like sitting on a chair,</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.202" end="00:17:11.102" style="s2">feet on the floor, no climbing. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.602" end="00:17:13.402" style="s2">This button flashes it when you finish.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.102" end="00:17:14.911" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. I was afraid to ask again.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.402" end="00:17:16.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can always ask.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.911" end="00:17:16.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.151" end="00:17:22.171" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.391" end="00:17:27.412" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.322" end="00:17:31.342" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:17:32.302" end="00:17:35.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are those for?</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.402" end="00:17:37.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.002" end="00:17:39.502" style="s2">I found a pot, but there&#39;s no firewood.</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.702" end="00:17:42.422" style="s2">Your garden is trying, but it isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.502" end="00:17:44.402" style="s2">helping very much.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.422" end="00:17:46.102" style="s2">[music] I&#39;ve seen one before. I &#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:17:44.402" end="00:17:47.602" style="s2">never used it.</p>
<p begin="00:17:46.102" end="00:17:49.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll do it together until you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.602" end="00:17:52.302" style="s2">comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.002" end="00:17:52.302" style="s2">There&#39;s no need to rush [music] this.</p>
<p begin="00:17:52.502" end="00:17:55.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.302" end="00:17:57.702" style="s2">Elliot, fire! You didn&#39;t even bring</p>
<p begin="00:17:55.502" end="00:17:59.402" style="s2">matches. How did it come like that?</p>
<p begin="00:17:57.702" end="00:18:03.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry Kukuwa, it&#39;s gas. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.402" end="00:18:03.802" style="s2">safe. See? I can control the fire.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.102" end="00:18:07.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you afraid of a little steam?</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.657" end="00:18:11.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.602" end="00:18:11.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just didn&#39;t want to block your light.</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.102" end="00:18:17.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey Elliot, so this fire can cook</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.102" end="00:18:18.402" style="s2">without firewood? You rich people are</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.302" end="00:18:20.303" style="s2">enjoying oh.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.402" end="00:18:23.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukuwa, you&#39;ll soon get used to it. Even</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.303" end="00:18:25.003" style="s2">the fire is your friend here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.203" end="00:18:27.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All this food is for you?</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.003" end="00:18:28.603" style="s2">At home, we decide what to cook after we</p>
<p begin="00:18:27.103" end="00:18:30.103" style="s2">count the money.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.603" end="00:18:31.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s for the house.</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.103" end="00:18:32.203" style="s2">For both of us.</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.547" end="00:18:34.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:32.203" end="00:18:36.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t waste anything.</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.203" end="00:18:37.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need to cook to earn your</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.003" end="00:18:38.803" style="s2">place here.</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.403" end="00:18:42.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.803" end="00:18:44.503" style="s2">I wanted to do something I understand.</p>
<p begin="00:18:42.703" end="00:18:46.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you&#39;re in charge of breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.503" end="00:18:49.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Start peeling. And don&#39;t disappear</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.903" end="00:18:53.003" style="s2">when the onion makes you cry.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.403" end="00:18:53.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I understand who&#39;s in charge.</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.403" end="00:18:57.748" style="s2">I have to deal with something at the</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.603" end="00:18:58.003" style="s2">office. You manage lunch?</p>
<p begin="00:18:57.748" end="00:18:59.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.003" end="00:19:02.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think so.</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.103" end="00:19:02.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. I&#39;ll call you later.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.918" end="00:19:08.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.673" end="00:19:22.693" style="s2">[bell]</p>
<p begin="00:19:26.568" end="00:19:28.588" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:19:29.188" end="00:19:31.208" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:19:37.703" end="00:19:43.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somebody help me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:40.303" end="00:19:45.703" style="s2">The whole kitchen is burning.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.103" end="00:19:47.203" style="s2">There&#39;s fire in the kitchen. I tried,</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.703" end="00:19:48.103" style="s2">but it keeps growing. I don&#39;t know what</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.203" end="00:19:50.303" style="s2">to do.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.103" end="00:19:52.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave the house now. Take nothing. Go</p>
<p begin="00:19:50.303" end="00:19:53.903" style="s2">outside.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.503" end="00:19:55.388" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But your kitchen, your things are</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.903" end="00:19:55.803" style="s2">inside.</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.388" end="00:19:57.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.803" end="00:19:58.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forget the things. Get clear of the</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.603" end="00:20:00.103" style="s2">house.</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.603" end="00:20:01.938" style="s2">Stay outside. I&#39;m calling the fire</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.103" end="00:20:02.903" style="s2">service now.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.938" end="00:20:05.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.903" end="00:20:06.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a kitchen fire at my house. One</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.103" end="00:20:08.103" style="s2">person has evacuated. I&#39;m sending the</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.903" end="00:20:09.903" style="s2">location.</p>
<p begin="00:20:08.103" end="00:20:12.303" style="s2">Please dispatch a crew. She&#39;ll wait</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.903" end="00:20:12.303" style="s2">outside.</p>
<p begin="00:20:24.003" end="00:20:29.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You never needed</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.405" end="00:20:32.705" style="s2">to have room inside my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.905" end="00:20:34.705" style="s2">I&#39;m still the girl you</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.705" end="00:20:37.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The [bell] fire is contained. Everything</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.705" end="00:20:40.005" style="s2">is under control. Take a deep breath. We</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.605" end="00:20:42.505" style="s2">got here just in time. It is going to be</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.005" end="00:20:44.905" style="s2">all right. [music] We are here to help.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.505" end="00:20:47.305" style="s2">The fire is under control. Please stay</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.905" end="00:20:49.805" style="s2">outside while we finish checking.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.305" end="00:20:52.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. Kuku, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.805" end="00:20:55.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m okay. I&#39;m so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:20:52.605" end="00:20:57.705" style="s2">You gave me somewhere safe, and I nearly</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.105" end="00:20:59.005" style="s2">destroyed it. I tried to stop the fire.</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.705" end="00:21:00.889" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got out.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.005" end="00:21:02.005" style="s2">That matters more than the kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.889" end="00:21:03.805" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:02.005" end="00:21:05.405" style="s2">I rushed the lesson, then left you</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.805" end="00:21:06.205" style="s2">alone. I should have checked you were</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.405" end="00:21:08.094" style="s2">ready.</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.205" end="00:21:08.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can it be repaired?</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.094" end="00:21:09.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="00:21:08.205" end="00:21:12.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.505" end="00:21:13.305" style="s2">We&#39;ll repair everything.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.005" end="00:21:16.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not sending me home?</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.305" end="00:21:18.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. You&#39;re not a bill I can return.</p>
<p begin="00:21:16.305" end="00:21:19.805" style="s2">We&#39;ll deal with this properly together.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.605" end="00:21:21.205" style="s2">Please stop blaming yourself for</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.805" end="00:21:23.205" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="00:21:21.205" end="00:21:25.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you about this girl. You brought</p>
<p begin="00:21:23.205" end="00:21:27.305" style="s2">a villager here, and now your kitchen is</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.305" end="00:21:29.105" style="s2">destroyed. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.305" end="00:21:31.705" style="s2">Lower your voice.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.105" end="00:21:33.305" style="s2">She could have been hurt. Let her go.</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.705" end="00:21:34.405" style="s2">How much more must happen before you</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.305" end="00:21:35.805" style="s2">listen?</p>
<p begin="00:21:34.405" end="00:21:38.005" style="s2">I left her with equipment she didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.805" end="00:21:41.005" style="s2">understand. This isn&#39;t proof that she&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.005" end="00:21:43.405" style="s2">worthless. I&#39;m trying to protect you.</p>
<p begin="00:21:41.005" end="00:21:45.905" style="s2">Then help me repair the kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:21:43.405" end="00:21:47.395" style="s2">Don&#39;t use an accident to humiliate</p>
<p begin="00:21:45.905" end="00:21:49.415" style="s2">someone who is already frightened.</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.395" end="00:21:49.415" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.305" end="00:21:57.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try this one.</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.905" end="00:21:58.705" style="s2">Please, is that price for the whole</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.305" end="00:22:00.305" style="s2">shelf?</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.705" end="00:22:02.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try it first. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.305" end="00:22:04.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trying it is free?</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.705" end="00:22:06.105" style="s2">Completely free.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.605" end="00:22:07.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s beautiful, but I won&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.105" end="00:22:08.705" style="s2">comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:22:07.305" end="00:22:10.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then choose another.</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.705" end="00:22:12.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not annoyed? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:10.205" end="00:22:14.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re wearing it, not me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.005" end="00:22:16.105" style="s2">Choose something you can enjoy.</p>
<p begin="00:22:14.205" end="00:22:18.205" style="s2">You have a good eye.</p>
<p begin="00:22:16.105" end="00:22:19.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still look like me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.205" end="00:22:20.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you expecting?</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.505" end="00:22:21.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone who could afford the whole</p>
<p begin="00:22:20.705" end="00:22:24.730" style="s2">shelf.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.905" end="00:22:26.750" style="s2">Definitely not me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.730" end="00:22:26.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.245" end="00:22:35.265" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.606" end="00:22:39.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey sister, your natural hair is so</p>
<p begin="00:22:37.806" end="00:22:42.106" style="s2">beautiful and thick.</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.706" end="00:22:45.035" style="s2">Have you ever cut it? No, not even once.</p>
<p begin="00:22:42.106" end="00:22:45.506" style="s2">I&#39;ve never cut my hair since I was born.</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.035" end="00:22:47.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.506" end="00:22:50.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s bigger than I imagined.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.506" end="00:22:52.206" style="s2">But I know that woman in the mirror.</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.306" end="00:22:54.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. That&#39;s the woman we came here</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.206" end="00:22:54.506" style="s2">with.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.860" end="00:22:56.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.506" end="00:23:05.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know chicken. Everything written</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.506" end="00:23:06.906" style="s2">around it is confusing me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.106" end="00:23:08.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask what it comes with.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.906" end="00:23:10.006" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to pretend you understand</p>
<p begin="00:23:08.406" end="00:23:12.006" style="s2">the menu. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:10.006" end="00:23:14.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, waiter.</p>
<p begin="00:23:12.006" end="00:23:16.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A little softer. He&#39;s coming.</p>
<p begin="00:23:14.406" end="00:23:17.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the chop bar, nobody hears you unless</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.806" end="00:23:20.706" style="s2">you shout.</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.906" end="00:23:20.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How can I help you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.006" end="00:23:25.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.106" end="00:23:26.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were hungry a minute ago.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.506" end="00:23:28.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re looking.</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.806" end="00:23:30.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at me. [music] We have nowhere to</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.406" end="00:23:30.906" style="s2">rush to.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.406" end="00:23:34.806" style="s2">Hold the food steady with the fork.</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.306" end="00:23:36.781" style="s2">Slowly. There.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.806" end="00:23:36.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You make everything look easy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.781" end="00:23:38.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.906" end="00:23:41.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have seen my first dinner</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.906" end="00:23:42.706" style="s2">with foreign clients.</p>
<p begin="00:23:41.006" end="00:23:44.506" style="s2">I spent half the meal watching which</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.706" end="00:23:45.506" style="s2">spoon everybody picked.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.506" end="00:23:46.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You?</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.506" end="00:23:47.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.506" end="00:23:49.226" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have told me before I nearly</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.906" end="00:23:51.246" style="s2">ran away.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.226" end="00:23:51.246" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.156" end="00:23:55.176" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.506" end="00:24:00.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still fighting the television?</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.206" end="00:24:02.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one changes channels. That one</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.106" end="00:24:04.006" style="s2">changes everything else.</p>
<p begin="00:24:02.106" end="00:24:06.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s for the sound system. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.006" end="00:24:07.406" style="s2">opened a school in your house.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.206" end="00:24:09.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m serious.</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.406" end="00:24:11.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clothes, accommodation, school fees.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.906" end="00:24:12.006" style="s2">Have you thought about how far this</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.106" end="00:24:14.706" style="s2">goes?</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.006" end="00:24:16.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. She can hear you. Speak to me with</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.706" end="00:24:18.706" style="s2">some respect.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.406" end="00:24:20.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You barely know her.</p>
<p begin="00:24:18.706" end="00:24:22.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll get to know her.</p>
<p begin="00:24:20.906" end="00:24:24.406" style="s2">And if she disappoints you</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.906" end="00:24:26.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She hasn&#39;t. Don&#39;t punish her for</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.406" end="00:24:28.106" style="s2">something you fear.</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.506" end="00:24:28.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You haven&#39;t unpacked.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.106" end="00:24:30.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perhaps we should</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.707" end="00:24:30.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; return some.</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.007" end="00:24:32.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.807" end="00:24:33.111" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your friend is worried about what I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.007" end="00:24:33.507" style="s2">costing you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.111" end="00:24:35.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.507" end="00:24:37.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard enough.</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.908" end="00:24:39.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I come in?</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.307" end="00:24:40.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.207" end="00:24:43.607" style="s2">Since we arrived, you&#39;ve taught me how</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.707" end="00:24:45.707" style="s2">to cook here, how to eat, even how</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.607" end="00:24:48.607" style="s2">loudly to speak.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.707" end="00:24:51.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those are unfamiliar things. That&#39;s all.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.607" end="00:24:53.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At home, I knew what I was doing.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.307" end="00:24:54.607" style="s2">Here, I keep waiting to make the next</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.107" end="00:24:56.408" style="s2">mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.607" end="00:24:57.507" style="s2">When I close my eyes, I still see the</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.408" end="00:25:00.007" style="s2">smoke.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.507" end="00:25:01.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. The repairs have started. You</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.007" end="00:25:04.607" style="s2">don&#39;t have to repair yourself to deserve</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.807" end="00:25:05.908" style="s2">a room. Breakfast was good.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.607" end="00:25:07.107" style="s2">You changed that dress before the</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.908" end="00:25:08.007" style="s2">attendant thought of it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.107" end="00:25:09.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s different.</p>
<p begin="00:25:08.007" end="00:25:11.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s still you.</p>
<p begin="00:25:09.507" end="00:25:13.107" style="s2">Those abilities didn&#39;t vanish here. You</p>
<p begin="00:25:11.507" end="00:25:15.107" style="s2">thought of your mother before buying</p>
<p begin="00:25:13.107" end="00:25:16.408" style="s2">anything for yourself. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.107" end="00:25:18.007" style="s2">That didn&#39;t disappear because you</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.408" end="00:25:21.007" style="s2">struggled with a fork.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.007" end="00:25:24.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I disappoint you?</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.007" end="00:25:25.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we talk. We solve what we can.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.107" end="00:25:27.607" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to pack your bag every</p>
<p begin="00:25:25.607" end="00:25:30.807" style="s2">time something goes wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:25:27.607" end="00:25:30.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to believe that.</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.302" end="00:25:40.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:37.908" end="00:25:41.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a fashion showcase this weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.107" end="00:25:42.807" style="s2">Would you like to come?</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.707" end="00:25:44.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To help? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.807" end="00:25:46.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As my guest, you won&#39;t be carrying</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.607" end="00:25:47.908" style="s2">anyone&#39;s shopping bags.</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.207" end="00:25:49.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those people will know everything I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.908" end="00:25:49.607" style="s2">still learning.</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.092" end="00:25:50.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:25:49.607" end="00:25:51.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Probably know how to make your</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.607" end="00:25:53.207" style="s2">breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:25:51.408" end="00:25:56.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You keep mentioning that breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:25:53.207" end="00:25:56.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It deserves recognition.</p>
<p begin="00:25:56.707" end="00:25:59.908" style="s2">Will you stay with me?</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.307" end="00:26:02.107" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to walk in alone.</p>
<p begin="00:25:59.908" end="00:26:03.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. We&#39;ll arrive together. You can take</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.107" end="00:26:06.507" style="s2">your [music] time. There&#39;s no</p>
<p begin="00:26:03.307" end="00:26:06.507" style="s2">performance to pass.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.107" end="00:26:22.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who built all these beautiful places?</p>
<p begin="00:26:20.307" end="00:26:24.307" style="s2">Was it the king or the president?</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.107" end="00:26:26.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Many people, architects, builders,</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.307" end="00:26:28.007" style="s2">business owners. Some buildings belong</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.307" end="00:26:30.107" style="s2">to the state.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.007" end="00:26:32.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So one person can imagine something this</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.107" end="00:26:33.609" style="s2">big and other people help it stand?</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.409" end="00:26:35.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.609" end="00:26:38.109" style="s2">A drawing becomes a building through</p>
<p begin="00:26:35.709" end="00:26:40.109" style="s2">many hands.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.109" end="00:26:41.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And tonight I&#39;m allowed inside one of</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.109" end="00:26:43.509" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.509" end="00:26:46.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re invited. You don&#39;t need to make</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.509" end="00:26:46.709" style="s2">yourself smaller at the door.</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.909" end="00:26:54.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Mensah.</p>
<p begin="00:26:53.909" end="00:26:57.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.409" end="00:26:58.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Asante. This way, please.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.109" end="00:27:00.309" style="s2">She knew my name.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.509" end="00:27:01.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You told me to put it down.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.309" end="00:27:03.818" style="s2">Your seat is waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.798" end="00:27:03.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.009" end="00:27:15.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at how that dress moves. The cloth</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.509" end="00:27:16.709" style="s2">looked heavy until she started walking.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.409" end="00:27:18.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You like it?</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.709" end="00:27:21.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You noticed that.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.409" end="00:27:24.309" style="s2">Sorry. Was I talking too loudly? No, I</p>
<p begin="00:27:21.209" end="00:27:27.209" style="s2">was asking. It opens when she turns.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.309" end="00:27:29.909" style="s2">Like somebody thought about every step.</p>
<p begin="00:27:27.209" end="00:27:30.709" style="s2">Do you study fashion? No, I mostly mend</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.909" end="00:27:32.909" style="s2">things. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.709" end="00:27:36.709" style="s2">That scarf around your waist. Your idea?</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.909" end="00:27:38.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. The dress needed something there.</p>
<p begin="00:27:36.709" end="00:27:40.509" style="s2">We have an open day next week. Come and</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.809" end="00:27:42.409" style="s2">see what we do.</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.509" end="00:27:43.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I would like that. May I bring some</p>
<p begin="00:27:42.409" end="00:27:45.609" style="s2">things I&#39;ve made?</p>
<p begin="00:27:43.409" end="00:27:47.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please do. Finished or unfinished, bring</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.609" end="00:27:49.609" style="s2">them. Then you&#39;ll see plenty of</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.409" end="00:27:50.924" style="s2">unfinished things. Good. That&#39;s where</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.609" end="00:27:52.944" style="s2">teaching begins.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.924" end="00:27:52.944" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.199" end="00:27:56.219" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.819" end="00:27:58.839" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.509" end="00:28:09.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do students make everything here?</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.409" end="00:28:12.309" style="s2">Eventually. First they learn why their</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.709" end="00:28:14.504" style="s2">first attempts don&#39;t fit. Then I already</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.309" end="00:28:15.509" style="s2">have something in common with them them.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.504" end="00:28:17.509" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.509" end="00:28:20.109" style="s2">I&#39;ve repaired sleeves like this. Mine</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.509" end="00:28:22.309" style="s2">never sat quite right. We can teach you</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.109" end="00:28:24.809" style="s2">why. Curiosity is a useful place to</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.309" end="00:28:24.809" style="s2">start.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.509" end="00:28:29.009" style="s2">This is only the first term.</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.409" end="00:28:30.809" style="s2">There&#39;s equipment, too.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.009" end="00:28:33.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, I&#39;ve seen it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.809" end="00:28:36.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can find somewhere cheaper.</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.009" end="00:28:37.710" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to waste your money.</p>
<p begin="00:28:36.010" end="00:28:39.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you like what you saw?</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.710" end="00:28:41.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very much.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.310" end="00:28:42.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s discuss the cost properly.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.210" end="00:28:44.910" style="s2">Don&#39;t reject something you want because</p>
<p begin="00:28:42.910" end="00:28:46.910" style="s2">you&#39;re frightened to ask. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:44.910" end="00:28:49.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if I&#39;m not good?</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.910" end="00:28:51.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re enrolling to learn, Kukua, not to</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.410" end="00:28:53.210" style="s2">prove you already know.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.910" end="00:28:55.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where do I sign?</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.210" end="00:28:56.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here. We&#39;ll explain the timetable before</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.510" end="00:28:56.610" style="s2">you leave.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.424" end="00:28:57.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.610" end="00:29:01.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your time.</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.810" end="00:29:03.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This time I want to move forward.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.010" end="00:29:03.030" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.595" end="00:29:07.615" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.215" end="00:29:09.610" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.310" end="00:29:10.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me your name and something you</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.610" end="00:29:13.410" style="s2">enjoy.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.810" end="00:29:15.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning. My name is</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.410" end="00:29:16.730" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here, Kukua, not across the</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.110" end="00:29:18.750" style="s2">compound.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.730" end="00:29:18.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.810" end="00:29:22.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the ceremonies, nobody heard me</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.510" end="00:29:24.310" style="s2">unless I shouted.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.310" end="00:29:27.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here, you don&#39;t need to fight the music.</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.310" end="00:29:30.010" style="s2">Speak to me just across this table.</p>
<p begin="00:29:27.410" end="00:29:32.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My name is Kukua Asante</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.010" end="00:29:34.710" style="s2">and now you&#39;ve disappeared.</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.210" end="00:29:38.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apparently, I have only two volumes.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.710" end="00:29:40.410" style="s2">We&#39;ll find the one that feels natural.</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.410" end="00:29:41.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One voice for the whole village, another</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.410" end="00:29:43.410" style="s2">nobody can hear.</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.810" end="00:29:45.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll find the one between them.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.410" end="00:29:47.570" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And it will still sound like you.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.550" end="00:29:47.570" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.610" end="00:29:52.310" style="s2">My name is Kukua Asante. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.710" end="00:29:54.610" style="s2">I&#39;m studying fashion.</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.310" end="00:29:56.685" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep going. Tell me what you enjoy about</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.610" end="00:29:58.410" style="s2">it. Forget the phone for a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.685" end="00:29:59.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.410" end="00:30:01.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I like taking something people have</p>
<p begin="00:29:59.910" end="00:30:03.910" style="s2">stopped wearing and finding a reason for</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.810" end="00:30:08.010" style="s2">them to wear it again.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.910" end="00:30:08.010" style="s2">That. [music] Say it exactly like that.</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.475" end="00:30:12.460" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.440" end="00:30:12.460" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.010" end="00:30:18.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And when your light grew weak and you</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.210" end="00:30:19.710" style="s2">were [singing] still everything</p>
<p begin="00:30:18.300" end="00:30:22.010" style="s2">[music] to me,</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.710" end="00:30:24.610" style="s2">I came with the defeat.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.010" end="00:30:26.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe in you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:24.610" end="00:30:27.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please tell me I haven&#39;t broken it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.510" end="00:30:29.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You haven&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.810" end="00:30:33.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It has stopped listening to me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.810" end="00:30:33.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s try again. There&#39;s no hurry here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.310" end="00:30:37.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was doing well until I remembered you</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.212" end="00:30:39.612" style="s2">were watching.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.712" end="00:30:43.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at the space ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.612" end="00:30:43.412" style="s2">We&#39;ll do one thing at a time. Ready?</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.612" end="00:30:56.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How was it?</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.412" end="00:30:57.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yesterday I stalled five times. Today,</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.412" end="00:30:58.412" style="s2">four.</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.112" end="00:31:00.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An improvement.</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.412" end="00:31:04.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A very expensive improvement, but I</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.512" end="00:31:04.012" style="s2">completed the 10 by myself.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.312" end="00:31:06.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. You kept trying.</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.116" end="00:31:08.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.412" end="00:31:10.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have seen me. I didn&#39;t ask</p>
<p begin="00:31:08.312" end="00:31:13.321" style="s2">him to touch the wheel.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.112" end="00:31:14.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time, tell me every detail.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.321" end="00:31:16.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.712" end="00:31:18.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One day I&#39;ll drive you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.312" end="00:31:20.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I look forward to it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.212" end="00:31:22.491" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After Martin stops gripping his seat, I</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.812" end="00:31:23.512" style="s2">should give him time to recover.</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.491" end="00:31:24.912" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.512" end="00:31:27.412" style="s2">Turn slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.912" end="00:31:30.212" style="s2">Let the skirt settle before you stop. I</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.412" end="00:31:33.112" style="s2">changed the side panels twice. It shows</p>
<p begin="00:31:30.212" end="00:31:35.312" style="s2">you listen to the fabric.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.112" end="00:31:39.112" style="s2">Have you considered modeling as well as</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.312" end="00:31:41.312" style="s2">design? Me? Your height, your eyes, the</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.112" end="00:31:43.312" style="s2">way you carry the garment. There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.312" end="00:31:44.912" style="s2">potential.</p>
<p begin="00:31:43.312" end="00:31:47.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Potential sounds like something that</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.912" end="00:31:49.912" style="s2">still needs work, a great deal.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.612" end="00:31:51.311" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. For a moment I thought you meant I</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.912" end="00:31:52.312" style="s2">was finished learning.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.311" end="00:31:54.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.312" end="00:31:56.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The training here is designed to stretch</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.412" end="00:31:58.712" style="s2">your abilities. You just have to trust</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.712" end="00:31:59.812" style="s2">the process, Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.712" end="00:32:02.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.812" end="00:32:04.912" style="s2">I&#39;m ready to commit to the work</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.412" end="00:32:06.712" style="s2">if this is what you want.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.912" end="00:32:08.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to try, but I won&#39;t stop</p>
<p begin="00:32:06.712" end="00:32:10.012" style="s2">designing.</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.212" end="00:32:11.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have to. We&#39;ll plan both</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.012" end="00:32:13.112" style="s2">properly.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.312" end="00:32:14.212" style="s2">Is that all water?</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.112" end="00:32:15.812" style="s2">Where does it finish?</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.212" end="00:32:17.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the sea.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.812" end="00:32:20.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know the word. I didn&#39;t know it could</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.712" end="00:32:20.912" style="s2">fill the whole screen.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.212" end="00:32:24.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take you tomorrow. You can see it</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.012" end="00:32:26.012" style="s2">for yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.112" end="00:32:28.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.012" end="00:32:29.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not just passing in the car.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.112" end="00:32:31.912" style="s2">We&#39;ll walk on the beach.</p>
<p begin="00:32:29.957" end="00:32:33.612" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.912" end="00:32:35.512" style="s2">Don&#39;t faint when you reach there.</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.612" end="00:32:36.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t stand behind me. I&#39;m taller</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.512" end="00:32:38.313" style="s2">than you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.312" end="00:32:39.782" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. We&#39;re going to the beach, not</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.313" end="00:32:40.713" style="s2">a wrestling match.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.782" end="00:32:42.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.713" end="00:32:45.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; grow</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.313" end="00:32:48.913" style="s2">and watch me learn to [singing] fly.</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.313" end="00:32:50.913" style="s2">But hid the fallen pieces when I asked</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.913" end="00:32:53.113" style="s2">if you were fine.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.913" end="00:32:54.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You both came dressed as if the sea sent</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.113" end="00:32:57.413" style="s2">invitations.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.513" end="00:33:00.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It did. Mine said orange. Come on,</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.413" end="00:33:00.613" style="s2">before she changes her mind.</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.913" end="00:33:04.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How will I know we&#39;re near?</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.313" end="00:33:06.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll hear it before you believe it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.513" end="00:33:08.313" style="s2">And you can stay on the sand. Nobody is</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.613" end="00:33:11.113" style="s2">making you swim.</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.313" end="00:33:12.213" style="s2">Nobody is making you swim.</p>
<p begin="00:33:11.113" end="00:33:16.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey!</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.213" end="00:33:16.713" style="s2">This is flat and wonderful, Elliot.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.713" end="00:33:23.313" style="s2">Hey! It&#39;s coming! That water is coming</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.313" end="00:33:25.113" style="s2">here!</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.313" end="00:33:25.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re well back. You&#39;re safe on this dry</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.113" end="00:33:27.713" style="s2">sand.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.913" end="00:33:29.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY! [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.713" end="00:33:31.913" style="s2">IT DOESN&#39;T LOOK SAFE.</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.713" end="00:33:33.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at me. We&#39;re staying here. Nobody</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.913" end="00:33:35.613" style="s2">will pull you toward the water.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.913" end="00:33:39.113" style="s2">You&#39;re all right.</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.613" end="00:33:39.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why does it sound so angry?</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.713" end="00:33:55.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everybody saw me running.</p>
<p begin="00:33:52.513" end="00:33:57.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve gone back to their own business.</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.013" end="00:34:00.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time, warn me before you introduce</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.013" end="00:34:02.913" style="s2">me to something this big.</p>
<p begin="00:34:00.113" end="00:34:04.613" style="s2">I want to look again. Just [music] here.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.913" end="00:34:06.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let go yet.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.613" end="00:34:07.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.013" end="00:34:09.013" style="s2">It&#39;s beautiful when I remember to</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.513" end="00:34:11.613" style="s2">breathe.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.013" end="00:34:12.413" style="s2">Tomorrow, tell nobody about the running.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.613" end="00:34:14.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which running?</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.413" end="00:34:15.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. You&#39;re learning.</p>
<p begin="00:34:14.413" end="00:34:18.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you go back?</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.313" end="00:34:20.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. But the sea must behave.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.913" end="00:34:25.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; While strangers [music] called my name</p>
<p begin="00:34:20.653" end="00:34:25.113" style="s2">[singing] beneath those shining lights.</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.913" end="00:34:30.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve been walking all my life.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.313" end="00:34:31.313" style="s2">Now I need lessons.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.013" end="00:34:34.013" style="s2">You&#39;re rushing because you want to</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.313" end="00:34:35.313" style="s2">finish before anyone looks. You noticed</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.013" end="00:34:36.913" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.313" end="00:34:39.513" style="s2">Let them look.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.913" end="00:34:41.613" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to race past them.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.513" end="00:34:42.714" style="s2">And if they don&#39;t like what they see,</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.613" end="00:34:46.014" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.714" end="00:34:47.214" style="s2">finish your walk, start again.</p>
<p begin="00:34:46.014" end="00:34:48.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you tired?</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.214" end="00:34:49.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Very.</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.314" end="00:34:52.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then rest.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.614" end="00:34:53.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more. I nearly had it. Please watch</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.314" end="00:34:56.314" style="s2">this one without telling me it&#39;s good</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.714" end="00:34:56.314" style="s2">too soon.</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.714" end="00:35:04.314" style="s2">Was that better?</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.214" end="00:35:05.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t apologize with your</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.314" end="00:35:07.114" style="s2">shoulders.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.514" end="00:35:09.779" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t know they were talking.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.114" end="00:35:11.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today they finally sounded like you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.779" end="00:35:11.799" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:17.514" end="00:35:21.514" style="s2">This is the same girl?</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.114" end="00:35:22.814" style="s2">The one from the engagement? Yes. You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.514" end="00:35:24.714" style="s2">asked twice.</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.814" end="00:35:27.614" style="s2">I&#39;m trying to recognize the confidence.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.714" end="00:35:27.614" style="s2">She looks different.</p>
<p begin="00:35:32.814" end="00:35:37.314" style="s2">School,</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.914" end="00:35:38.314" style="s2">driving lessons, coaches every weekend.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.314" end="00:35:39.909" style="s2">How much have you spent?</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.314" end="00:35:40.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can afford it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.909" end="00:35:43.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.314" end="00:35:46.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That isn&#39;t what I&#39;m asking. Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.314" end="00:35:48.014" style="s2">You smile before you even say her name.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.214" end="00:35:50.814" style="s2">She&#39;s worked hard.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.014" end="00:35:53.214" style="s2">That wasn&#39;t a denial. Tell her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.814" end="00:35:55.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not now.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.214" end="00:35:58.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.314" end="00:35:59.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because she still depends on me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.214" end="00:36:03.714" style="s2">I don&#39;t want her wondering whether</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.714" end="00:36:06.214" style="s2">saying no would cost her everything.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.714" end="00:36:08.714" style="s2">And when she doesn&#39;t need you anymore,</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.214" end="00:36:12.314" style="s2">then she won&#39;t need me anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.714" end="00:36:12.314" style="s2">You say that as though it won&#39;t hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.625" end="00:36:16.645" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:36:17.244" end="00:36:19.265" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.830" end="00:36:26.014" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.014" end="00:36:27.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukua Asante, please stand by.</p>
<p begin="00:36:26.014" end="00:36:28.380" style="s2">That&#39;s me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:27.414" end="00:36:30.514" style="s2">Take your breath before your first</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.380" end="00:36:33.014" style="s2">[music] step. You&#39;ve done the work. Go</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.514" end="00:36:33.014" style="s2">and use it.</p>
<p begin="00:36:37.550" end="00:36:39.570" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.790" end="00:36:44.810" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.720" end="00:36:48.740" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.340" end="00:36:52.670" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:36:50.650" end="00:36:52.670" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.316" end="00:37:00.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you see?</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.516" end="00:37:02.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every step.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.216" end="00:37:04.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I nearly forgot the turn.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.716" end="00:37:07.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you didn&#39;t. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.216" end="00:37:08.990" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For once, I didn&#39;t want to disappear.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.025" end="00:37:11.010" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.990" end="00:37:11.010" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.816" end="00:37:17.516" style="s2">Whose car is this?</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.916" end="00:37:19.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yours. A new Lexus.</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.516" end="00:37:21.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t joke with me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.470" end="00:37:23.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:37:21.416" end="00:37:24.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a gift. The paperwork is in your</p>
<p begin="00:37:23.216" end="00:37:25.716" style="s2">name.</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.016" end="00:37:30.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this car really for me?</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.716" end="00:37:31.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Kukua. It&#39;s for you. All yours.</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.316" end="00:37:33.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey,</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.216" end="00:37:35.216" style="s2">my own car!</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.225" end="00:37:37.416" style="s2">[gasps] Oh my god!</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.216" end="00:37:40.416" style="s2">Thank you, Elliot. Thank you!</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.416" end="00:37:40.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re welcome, Kukua.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.741" end="00:37:45.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.816" end="00:37:48.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you so so much. God bless you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.416" end="00:37:48.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You deserve it, Kukua.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.716" end="00:37:53.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I used to count transport money before</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.316" end="00:37:54.916" style="s2">leaving home. Now you&#39;re giving me a</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.016" end="00:37:56.816" style="s2">whole car.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.916" end="00:37:59.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One step at a time.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.816" end="00:38:02.216" style="s2">Take a breath.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.116" end="00:38:03.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t even want dust to touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.216" end="00:38:05.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then it will spend its life under a</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.616" end="00:38:08.916" style="s2">cover.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.116" end="00:38:11.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For today, let it remain perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.916" end="00:38:13.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A Lexus, a new life.</p>
<p begin="00:38:11.516" end="00:38:14.816" style="s2">When do you tell her about your heart?</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.016" end="00:38:16.716" style="s2">The gift isn&#39;t a proposal. Then use</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.816" end="00:38:18.416" style="s2">words.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.716" end="00:38:19.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, check your phone. [music] I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.416" end="00:38:20.816" style="s2">sent you something.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.516" end="00:38:22.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What have you sent?</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.816" end="00:38:25.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something for the house. Open the</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.616" end="00:38:28.316" style="s2">message first, then tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.916" end="00:38:29.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it Elliot&#39;s money?</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.316" end="00:38:32.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:38:29.716" end="00:38:32.716" style="s2">Mine. They paid me for the show.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.016" end="00:38:34.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yours?</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.716" end="00:38:36.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I wanted you to have the first</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.916" end="00:38:37.916" style="s2">part.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.416" end="00:38:38.816" style="s2">Mama?</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.916" end="00:38:40.716" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.816" end="00:38:42.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your father would have made me show that</p>
<p begin="00:38:40.716" end="00:38:44.716" style="s2">message to the whole village.</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.916" end="00:38:47.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can show them. Tell them I am</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.716" end="00:38:47.216" style="s2">learning.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.416" end="00:38:50.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Instagram and</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.917" end="00:38:52.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Facebook are ready. We&#39;ve set up TikTok,</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.217" end="00:38:54.317" style="s2">X, and Snapchat too.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.417" end="00:38:56.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five places for people to tell me what</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.317" end="00:38:56.717" style="s2">they think.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.817" end="00:39:00.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five places to show your work. Now</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.817" end="00:39:01.617" style="s2">change the passwords.</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.117" end="00:39:03.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t want them?</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.617" end="00:39:05.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re your accounts. Keep control of</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.617" end="00:39:07.217" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.617" end="00:39:09.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You keep giving me things and stepping</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.217" end="00:39:10.822" style="s2">away.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.017" end="00:39:10.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m still here.</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.822" end="00:39:12.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.917" end="00:39:13.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.017" end="00:39:15.517" style="s2">I&#39;m beginning to understand the</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.217" end="00:39:17.517" style="s2">difference.</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.517" end="00:39:18.417" style="s2">From my first campaign payment, I chose</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.517" end="00:39:19.317" style="s2">the cloth myself.</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.417" end="00:39:20.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t have to.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.317" end="00:39:23.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted to.</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.817" end="00:39:25.617" style="s2">Open it before you start arguing.</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.917" end="00:39:27.517" style="s2">You chose this for me?</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.617" end="00:39:28.417" style="s2">Yes. Something you didn&#39;t buy for</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.517" end="00:39:29.717" style="s2">yourself. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.417" end="00:39:31.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.717" end="00:39:33.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. You&#39;re difficult to buy things</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.417" end="00:39:33.717" style="s2">for.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.617" end="00:39:41.717" style="s2">Please don&#39;t argue about the next</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.117" end="00:39:42.517" style="s2">present either.</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.717" end="00:39:44.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll try.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.517" end="00:39:45.537" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Now turn around. I&#39;m changing my</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.517" end="00:39:46.017" style="s2">passwords.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.537" end="00:39:48.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.017" end="00:39:48.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As you should.</p>
<p begin="00:39:52.742" end="00:39:54.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.117" end="00:40:05.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Instagram page has grown again.</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.417" end="00:40:06.917" style="s2">People are sharing the new photographs.</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.517" end="00:40:10.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re seeing your work.</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.917" end="00:40:10.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you&#39;re still here after every show.</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.082" end="00:40:15.217" style="s2">[applause] My X and TikTok accounts are</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.817" end="00:40:16.817" style="s2">verified now. Both of them.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.217" end="00:40:18.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sound surprised.</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.817" end="00:40:21.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still remember being surprised</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.417" end="00:40:21.617" style="s2">somebody knew my name.</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.217" end="00:40:24.237" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.617" end="00:40:30.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her campaigns caught our attention.</p>
<p begin="00:40:29.117" end="00:40:32.917" style="s2">Look at the control in her walk and the</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.917" end="00:40:35.217" style="s2">way she holds the clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.917" end="00:40:37.417" style="s2">She has a distinctive presence. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.217" end="00:40:39.117" style="s2">Her agency can confirm availability.</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.417" end="00:40:40.117" style="s2">She&#39;s building experience through shows</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.117" end="00:40:41.817" style="s2">in Ghana.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.117" end="00:40:43.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the campaign direction?</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.817" end="00:40:45.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She fits it. Her work already connects</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.917" end="00:40:46.417" style="s2">with audiences.</p>
<p begin="00:40:45.017" end="00:40:48.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we agree.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.417" end="00:40:50.418" style="s2">Send the proposal through her agency</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.317" end="00:40:52.218" style="s2">with the placement and terms.</p>
<p begin="00:40:50.418" end="00:40:55.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agreed. I&#39;ll coordinate it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.218" end="00:40:55.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s invite her into the conversation.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.418" end="00:41:06.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you read something? I&#39;ve read it</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.318" end="00:41:07.618" style="s2">three times and I&#39;m afraid I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.118" end="00:41:11.318" style="s2">misunderstood. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.618" end="00:41:13.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come. Let&#39;s look at it together.</p>
<p begin="00:41:11.318" end="00:41:15.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They contacted the agency after seeing</p>
<p begin="00:41:13.018" end="00:41:17.018" style="s2">my campaigns online. Evelyn says the</p>
<p begin="00:41:15.318" end="00:41:18.418" style="s2">company is real.</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.018" end="00:41:19.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Northstar Atelier. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.418" end="00:41:21.318" style="s2">They&#39;re offering you an international</p>
<p begin="00:41:19.718" end="00:41:22.618" style="s2">modeling contract.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.318" end="00:41:23.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Read the amount.</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.618" end="00:41:25.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukuwa.</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.718" end="00:41:27.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what I said. I thought I had</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.118" end="00:41:29.683" style="s2">counted the zeros wrongly.</p>
<p begin="00:41:27.418" end="00:41:31.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m reading it again just to be sure.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.683" end="00:41:32.718" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:41:31.218" end="00:41:34.268" style="s2">We&#39;ll have a lawyer review everything</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.718" end="00:41:34.518" style="s2">before you agree.</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.268" end="00:41:36.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:34.518" end="00:41:38.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I don&#39;t want excitement to make me</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.918" end="00:41:40.163" style="s2">careless.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.118" end="00:41:41.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll understand every part first.</p>
<p begin="00:41:40.163" end="00:41:42.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.218" end="00:41:44.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They put my name on it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.818" end="00:41:46.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course they did.</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.218" end="00:41:48.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Look. Not somebody they want to</p>
<p begin="00:41:46.418" end="00:41:50.718" style="s2">introduce me to. Me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.918" end="00:41:52.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. You.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.718" end="00:41:53.618" style="s2">The woman who kept getting up and trying</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.718" end="00:41:56.018" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.618" end="00:41:57.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wish mama could see this moment.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.018" end="00:41:59.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll tell her yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:41:57.849" end="00:41:59.869" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.918" end="00:42:03.018" style="s2">The initial placement is in New York.</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.018" end="00:42:03.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; America?</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.018" end="00:42:06.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.818" end="00:42:10.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew it was international.</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.018" end="00:42:11.518" style="s2">Somehow I hadn&#39;t imagined the distance.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.218" end="00:42:12.418" style="s2">You look happy.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.518" end="00:42:14.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.418" end="00:42:16.189" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just didn&#39;t know it would take me so</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.118" end="00:42:18.209" style="s2">far from you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.189" end="00:42:18.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.218" end="00:42:28.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company accepted the changes we</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.818" end="00:42:30.318" style="s2">requested.</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.118" end="00:42:32.818" style="s2">Accommodation, travel arrangements, and</p>
<p begin="00:42:30.318" end="00:42:35.218" style="s2">professional support are covered.</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.818" end="00:42:37.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I can come home between assignments?</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.218" end="00:42:39.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; According to the agreed schedule.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.149" end="00:42:40.718" style="s2">[music] Read that section again before</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.118" end="00:42:43.218" style="s2">signing.</p>
<p begin="00:42:40.718" end="00:42:46.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want to understand what I&#39;m promising,</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.218" end="00:42:48.284" style="s2">not just what they&#39;re paying.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.118" end="00:42:48.618" style="s2">You&#39;re very quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.284" end="00:42:51.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.618" end="00:42:52.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re asking the right questions.</p>
<p begin="00:42:51.018" end="00:42:53.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I keep waiting for somebody to tell</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.520" end="00:42:56.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; me</p>
<p begin="00:42:53.220" end="00:42:56.520" style="s2">I&#39;m sitting in the wrong chair.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.420" end="00:43:00.520" style="s2">There, I&#39;ve signed it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:59.120" end="00:43:02.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll arrange your copies.</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.520" end="00:43:05.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please keep one safe for me. I want to</p>
<p begin="00:43:02.720" end="00:43:07.020" style="s2">remember how my hand was shaking.</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.720" end="00:43:08.220" style="s2">We did it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.020" end="00:43:10.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:08.220" end="00:43:13.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please let me say we today.</p>
<p begin="00:43:10.420" end="00:43:16.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, today we did it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.420" end="00:43:18.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll put these beside the suitcase.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.420" end="00:43:20.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave something for us to carry.</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.620" end="00:43:23.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You bought enough for three winters.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.720" end="00:43:25.320" style="s2">There&#39;s plenty left.</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.320" end="00:43:26.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;ve bought her a Lexus, helped</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.320" end="00:43:29.220" style="s2">with the contract, and now you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.620" end="00:43:32.420" style="s2">helping her leave. She has a contract.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.220" end="00:43:32.420" style="s2">This is her opportunity.</p>
<p begin="00:43:33.520" end="00:43:36.720" style="s2">And you have feelings.</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.320" end="00:43:39.320" style="s2">Tell her.</p>
<p begin="00:43:36.720" end="00:43:41.220" style="s2">Not as a condition for going.</p>
<p begin="00:43:39.320" end="00:43:43.620" style="s2">Nobody said conditions. Say you love</p>
<p begin="00:43:41.220" end="00:43:45.820" style="s2">her. Let her answer. She still thanks me</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.620" end="00:43:47.120" style="s2">whenever something good happens.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.820" end="00:43:49.120" style="s2">I need to know she can separate</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.120" end="00:43:50.720" style="s2">gratitude from everything else. And when</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.120" end="00:43:52.420" style="s2">she has her own money,</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.720" end="00:43:54.620" style="s2">then she can decide without wondering</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.420" end="00:43:56.620" style="s2">what she owes me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.620" end="00:43:58.820" style="s2">America has men who won&#39;t wait for a</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.620" end="00:44:00.520" style="s2">committee meeting before asking.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.820" end="00:44:02.120" style="s2">I &#39;m serious.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.520" end="00:44:03.820" style="s2">You could lose her.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.120" end="00:44:05.520" style="s2">Keeping her here because I&#39;m afraid</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.820" end="00:44:08.020" style="s2">would be worse. Help me take this</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.520" end="00:44:08.020" style="s2">inside.</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.920" end="00:44:13.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have you packed something warm?</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.920" end="00:44:15.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, you&#39;ve asked four times. Then pack</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.720" end="00:44:16.420" style="s2">four things.</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.120" end="00:44:18.720" style="s2">You&#39;ll have me wearing the whole</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.420" end="00:44:20.620" style="s2">suitcase.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.720" end="00:44:23.220" style="s2">And Elliot, how is he?</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.620" end="00:44:24.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He keeps checking my documents.</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.220" end="00:44:26.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That wasn&#39;t what I asked.</p>
<p begin="00:44:24.520" end="00:44:28.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, Mama. I don&#39;t know how to</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.120" end="00:44:28.620" style="s2">answer.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.820" end="00:44:31.120" style="s2">He&#39;s here. I&#39;ll call you in the morning,</p>
<p begin="00:44:30.420" end="00:44:32.920" style="s2">Mama.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.120" end="00:44:34.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sleep if you can.</p>
<p begin="00:44:32.920" end="00:44:37.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I attach this?</p>
<p begin="00:44:34.620" end="00:44:37.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, come in.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.920" end="00:44:41.620" style="s2">Will you miss me?</p>
<p begin="00:44:40.220" end="00:44:43.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.620" end="00:44:44.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The house will be quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:44:43.520" end="00:44:47.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your call.</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.420" end="00:44:49.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That isn&#39;t the same. You know it isn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.720" end="00:44:51.220" style="s2">Sometimes I think there&#39;s something you</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.320" end="00:44:54.520" style="s2">want to tell me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.220" end="00:44:54.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want you to enjoy this opportunity.</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.520" end="00:44:57.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.721" end="00:44:59.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; already told me that.</p>
<p begin="00:44:57.721" end="00:45:01.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try to sleep. Everything is ready for</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.721" end="00:45:02.921" style="s2">the morning.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.521" end="00:45:04.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. Good night.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.921" end="00:45:06.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good night.</p>
<p begin="00:45:04.021" end="00:45:07.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for checking everything.</p>
<p begin="00:45:06.321" end="00:45:10.121" style="s2">Thank you for the love and care you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:45:07.921" end="00:45:10.821" style="s2">given my daughter. I see what you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.121" end="00:45:13.221" style="s2">done.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.821" end="00:45:14.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s worked hard, mama. She deserves</p>
<p begin="00:45:13.221" end="00:45:16.221" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.021" end="00:45:17.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, but you stood beside her when</p>
<p begin="00:45:16.221" end="00:45:19.521" style="s2">she needed someone.</p>
<p begin="00:45:17.521" end="00:45:20.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll keep encouraging her.</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.521" end="00:45:21.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.421" end="00:45:25.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look after yourself too.</p>
<p begin="00:45:21.921" end="00:45:25.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She worries about you.</p>
<p begin="00:45:31.421" end="00:45:35.921" style="s2">I hope you find some peace.</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.321" end="00:45:38.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wore it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.921" end="00:45:40.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Important occasion.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.121" end="00:45:42.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you&#39;d keep it in the box.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.621" end="00:45:44.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You chose it for me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.321" end="00:45:46.321" style="s2">I wanted you to see it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:44.121" end="00:45:48.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is where you leave me?</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.321" end="00:45:49.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is where you go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.321" end="00:45:51.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always find a better way to say</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.921" end="00:45:54.021" style="s2">something painful.</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.821" end="00:45:54.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call when you land, even if it&#39;s late.</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.021" end="00:45:55.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll answer?</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.921" end="00:45:57.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:45:55.821" end="00:45:58.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Promise you won&#39;t pretend you weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.221" end="00:45:59.621" style="s2">waiting.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.821" end="00:46:01.511" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll answer.</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.621" end="00:46:04.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The richest [music] to have room</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.511" end="00:46:04.721" style="s2">[singing] inside my heart.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.821" end="00:46:10.121" style="s2">I&#39;m still the girl you [music] believed</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.521" end="00:46:11.021" style="s2">in and I believe in you.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.121" end="00:46:12.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot?</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.021" end="00:46:13.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.121" end="00:46:14.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:46:13.221" end="00:46:17.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.421" end="00:46:20.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should go before I make this harder.</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.221" end="00:46:20.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take your time. I am still here.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.472" end="00:46:24.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.712" end="00:46:29.732" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.821" end="00:46:36.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did he never love me the way I love him?</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.121" end="00:46:38.521" style="s2">Does he see a sister?</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.621" end="00:46:41.121" style="s2">Elliot, I kept hoping you would say</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.521" end="00:46:41.121" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:46:41.921" end="00:46:45.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never wanted my help to feel like a</p>
<p begin="00:46:43.421" end="00:46:46.921" style="s2">price.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.021" end="00:46:48.421" style="s2">Safe journey, my love.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.921" end="00:46:50.921" style="s2">I hope you find everything you went</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.421" end="00:46:53.421" style="s2">looking for.</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.921" end="00:46:55.321" style="s2">I should have listened to Elvis.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.421" end="00:46:57.223" style="s2">I should have told her.</p>
<p begin="00:46:55.321" end="00:47:00.323" style="s2">But would she have heard love</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.223" end="00:47:03.922" style="s2">Or felt she owed me an answer?</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.323" end="00:47:05.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukua Asante, welcome. I&#39;m Claire. We&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.922" end="00:47:07.723" style="s2">been looking forward to meeting you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.523" end="00:47:09.622" style="s2">Thank you. I&#39;m very glad somebody knows</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.723" end="00:47:11.922" style="s2">where I should go. [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.622" end="00:47:14.223" style="s2">We&#39;ll take you to the apartment first.</p>
<p begin="00:47:11.922" end="00:47:16.523" style="s2">Our escort can help with your luggage.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.223" end="00:47:19.622" style="s2">Please. My mother packed as if I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.523" end="00:47:19.622" style="s2">moving a village.</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.077" end="00:47:24.097" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:27.922" end="00:47:32.023" style="s2">First time in New York?</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.823" end="00:47:33.823" style="s2">First time outside Ghana? Then we&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.023" end="00:47:37.523" style="s2">take it one day at a time. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.823" end="00:47:37.523" style="s2">have to learn to learn everything today.</p>
<p begin="00:47:39.622" end="00:47:44.422" style="s2">For your mother?</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.023" end="00:47:46.223" style="s2">Her too. Someone waiting for news? Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:47:44.422" end="00:47:48.277" style="s2">Someone who told me to call even if it</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.223" end="00:47:48.823" style="s2">was late.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.277" end="00:47:51.023" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.823" end="00:47:53.823" style="s2">He&#39;s asking whether I&#39;ve eaten. Good</p>
<p begin="00:47:51.023" end="00:47:55.323" style="s2">news? He sounds exactly like my mother.</p>
<p begin="00:47:53.823" end="00:47:58.523" style="s2">I crossed an ocean and the first</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.323" end="00:47:58.523" style="s2">question stayed the same.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.343" end="00:48:05.363" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.618" end="00:48:10.223" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:48:08.122" end="00:48:13.122" style="s2">That&#39;s it. Keep that expression. Strong</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.223" end="00:48:15.523" style="s2">eyes, relaxed shoulders, like this.</p>
<p begin="00:48:13.122" end="00:48:17.723" style="s2">Exact exactly. Let the clothes move</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.523" end="00:48:19.223" style="s2">around your confidence.</p>
<p begin="00:48:17.723" end="00:48:21.922" style="s2">Your [music] height, your very dark</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.223" end="00:48:24.122" style="s2">skin, those expressive eyes. People</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.922" end="00:48:25.023" style="s2">notice you. I hope they notice the work</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.122" end="00:48:27.723" style="s2">too. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.023" end="00:48:29.422" style="s2">That&#39;s why we&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:48:27.723" end="00:48:32.223" style="s2">Yesterday somebody asked for a</p>
<p begin="00:48:29.422" end="00:48:34.523" style="s2">photograph outside the hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:48:32.223" end="00:48:36.748" style="s2">Get used to being recognized.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.523" end="00:48:37.922" style="s2">I thought she wanted me to take hers.</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.748" end="00:48:40.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.922" end="00:48:40.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me. May I take a photograph with</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.023" end="00:48:43.422" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.922" end="00:48:45.823" style="s2">With me? Yes, of course.</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.422" end="00:48:48.723" style="s2">You&#39;re even taller in person. Your eyes</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.823" end="00:48:48.723" style="s2">are beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.922" end="00:48:54.223" style="s2">Thank you,</p>
<p begin="00:48:58.922" end="00:49:03.424" style="s2">Your queue is next. Take the turn at</p>
<p begin="00:49:00.824" end="00:49:06.224" style="s2">your own pace. Ready?</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.424" end="00:49:07.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ready. Ask me again after the applause.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.224" end="00:49:10.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.024" end="00:49:10.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was modeling</p>
<p begin="00:49:12.119" end="00:49:14.139" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:29.149" end="00:49:31.169" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.724" end="00:49:43.024" style="s2">always the plan?</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.524" end="00:49:47.024" style="s2">For a long time, the plan was simply to</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.024" end="00:49:48.324" style="s2">help my mother get through the week.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.024" end="00:49:50.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What changed?</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.324" end="00:49:53.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somebody gave me an opportunity, then</p>
<p begin="00:49:50.824" end="00:49:57.124" style="s2">other people taught me how to work for</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.224" end="00:49:58.624" style="s2">it. I&#39;m still learning every day.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.124" end="00:50:00.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does that first person know what he</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.624" end="00:50:02.724" style="s2">started?</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.824" end="00:50:04.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope he&#39;s watching.</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.724" end="00:50:07.324" style="s2">There are things I still haven&#39;t found</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.324" end="00:50:10.024" style="s2">the courage to tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.324" end="00:50:12.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He always said that true success is</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.024" end="00:50:16.624" style="s2">measured by what you leave behind,</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.424" end="00:50:16.624" style="s2">and his legacy will live on forever.</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.619" end="00:50:19.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.924" end="00:50:25.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every time we meet, we discuss</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.524" end="00:50:26.924" style="s2">campaigns.</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.024" end="00:50:28.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You usually bring a schedule.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.924" end="00:50:31.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.224" end="00:50:33.824" style="s2">I wanted this evening to belong to us.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.924" end="00:50:35.824" style="s2">I&#39;ve made my feelings clear.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.824" end="00:50:38.124" style="s2">I&#39;d like to build a life with you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.824" end="00:50:40.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, I didn&#39;t realize this was what</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.124" end="00:50:41.824" style="s2">you planned.</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.824" end="00:50:43.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wouldn&#39;t have to worry about</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.824" end="00:50:45.130" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.224" end="00:50:46.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That isn&#39;t what I need from a marriage.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.130" end="00:50:50.524" style="s2">[music] I can&#39;t promise a feeling</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.824" end="00:50:52.124" style="s2">because the future looks comfortable.</p>
<p begin="00:50:50.524" end="00:50:53.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is there someone else?</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.124" end="00:50:55.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s someone I can&#39;t pretend not to</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.724" end="00:50:56.924" style="s2">think about.</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.524" end="00:51:00.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does he know?</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.924" end="00:51:00.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t told him properly.</p>
<p begin="00:51:00.624" end="00:51:06.325" style="s2">I&#39;m sorry. I respect you too much to say</p>
<p begin="00:51:03.325" end="00:51:09.725" style="s2">yes when I don&#39;t feel what you feel.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.325" end="00:51:09.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; would rather hear the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.825" end="00:51:14.425" style="s2">Your work here remains your work. This</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.225" end="00:51:15.825" style="s2">won&#39;t change that.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.425" end="00:51:17.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.825" end="00:51:19.190" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t owe me an answer different</p>
<p begin="00:51:17.225" end="00:51:21.210" style="s2">from the one you mean.</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.190" end="00:51:21.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.085" end="00:51:27.105" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:51:27.525" end="00:51:32.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You turned down Adrien Whitmore?</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.925" end="00:51:34.025" style="s2">I turned down a marriage I don&#39;t want.</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.225" end="00:51:36.025" style="s2">For Elit?</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.025" end="00:51:39.425" style="s2">Don&#39;t make it sound so simple. Has he</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.025" end="00:51:39.425" style="s2">ever asked you to be with him?</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.325" end="00:51:43.725" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.625" end="00:51:46.425" style="s2">Then are you waiting for him or for an</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.725" end="00:51:48.525" style="s2">idea you&#39;ve made of him?</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.425" end="00:51:49.825" style="s2">I don&#39;t know what he feels. I know what</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.525" end="00:51:51.525" style="s2">I feel.</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.825" end="00:51:52.825" style="s2">Then tell him.</p>
<p begin="00:51:51.525" end="00:51:55.925" style="s2">He can&#39;t answer a question you keep</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.825" end="00:51:55.925" style="s2">asking only yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:51:57.325" end="00:52:00.525" style="s2">And if all he sees is the girl he</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.825" end="00:52:03.125" style="s2">helped?</p>
<p begin="00:52:00.525" end="00:52:04.425" style="s2">I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.125" end="00:52:05.925" style="s2">That&#39;s the answer I&#39;m frightened to hear</p>
<p begin="00:52:04.425" end="00:52:08.425" style="s2">from him.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.925" end="00:52:10.225" style="s2">You&#39;re using the small pots.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.425" end="00:52:12.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only one person here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:10.225" end="00:52:12.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember that kitchen sounding much</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.025" end="00:52:15.625" style="s2">busier.</p>
<p begin="00:52:12.725" end="00:52:15.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How was your evening?</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.025" end="00:52:18.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Complicated.</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.525" end="00:52:20.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something at work?</p>
<p begin="00:52:18.525" end="00:52:21.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somebody asked me to marry him.</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.425" end="00:52:22.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh.</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.025" end="00:52:25.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all?</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.525" end="00:52:27.325" style="s2">I&#39;ve been wondering how to tell you.</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.425" end="00:52:29.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you say?</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.325" end="00:52:29.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.225" end="00:52:31.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.925" end="00:52:33.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look relieved.</p>
<p begin="00:52:31.325" end="00:52:35.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want you to be happy.</p>
<p begin="00:52:33.625" end="00:52:39.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You always say what you want for me,</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.725" end="00:52:39.425" style="s2">never what you want for yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.225" end="00:52:44.625" style="s2">I&#39;m listening. Please finish what you</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.225" end="00:52:46.225" style="s2">just started.</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.625" end="00:52:47.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s late here.</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.225" end="00:52:48.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Sleep well.</p>
<p begin="00:52:47.925" end="00:52:49.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You too.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.725" end="00:52:51.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good night.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.525" end="00:52:51.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good [music] night.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.441" end="00:52:59.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.336" end="00:53:05.356" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.625" end="00:53:08.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; People expect</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.127" end="00:53:10.127" style="s2">that we&#39;re different from the previous</p>
<p begin="00:53:08.727" end="00:53:11.927" style="s2">administration.</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.127" end="00:53:14.527" style="s2">Then investigate the contracts. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.927" end="00:53:15.927" style="s2">Investigations take time. They want</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.527" end="00:53:17.527" style="s2">names now.</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.927" end="00:53:19.327" style="s2">Some of those companies may have done</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.527" end="00:53:21.127" style="s2">nothing wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.327" end="00:53:23.827" style="s2">We need people to see action. Five</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.127" end="00:53:26.427" style="s2">politicians, their [music] allies.</p>
<p begin="00:53:23.827" end="00:53:29.927" style="s2">The message must be clear.</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.427" end="00:53:31.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five politicians and 29 businessmen.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.927" end="00:53:32.927" style="s2">Elliot Mensah is among them.</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.727" end="00:53:35.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are we looking for evidence or</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.927" end="00:53:37.327" style="s2">scapegoats? Start with the records.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.427" end="00:53:39.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Following the change of administration,</p>
<p begin="00:53:37.327" end="00:53:41.127" style="s2">investigators have requested records for</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.327" end="00:53:43.327" style="s2">contracts awarded under the previous</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.127" end="00:53:45.327" style="s2">government. Inclusion in the inquiry</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.327" end="00:53:46.927" style="s2">does not establish [music] wrongdoing.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.327" end="00:53:47.727" style="s2">They&#39;ve requested the road project</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.927" end="00:53:49.227" style="s2">records.</p>
<p begin="00:53:47.727" end="00:53:50.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send them.</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.227" end="00:53:52.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the records, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:53:50.827" end="00:53:55.527" style="s2">They&#39;re investigating companies</p>
<p begin="00:53:52.027" end="00:53:55.527" style="s2">connected with the former minister.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.727" end="00:53:58.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our work was completed and certified.</p>
<p begin="00:53:57.047" end="00:53:59.427" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.227" end="00:54:01.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.427" end="00:54:03.527" style="s2">But our company&#39;s on the list.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.527" end="00:54:06.327" style="s2">Preserve everything. Arrange a meeting</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.527" end="00:54:06.327" style="s2">with our lawyers.</p>
<p begin="00:54:07.127" end="00:54:10.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Turning now [music] to international</p>
<p begin="00:54:08.527" end="00:54:14.027" style="s2">trade news. Markets indicate steady</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.927" end="00:54:14.027" style="s2">growth this quarter.</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.077" end="00:54:16.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.937" end="00:54:23.957" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.867" end="00:54:27.887" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.727" end="00:54:36.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why haven&#39;t the salaries gone through?</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.327" end="00:54:39.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bank stopped the transfers. There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.227" end="00:54:42.027" style="s2">an order freezing the company accounts.</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.527" end="00:54:42.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All of them?</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.827" end="00:54:47.627" style="s2">Move the payroll to my personal account,</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.727" end="00:54:49.627" style="s2">the one that isn&#39;t restricted.</p>
<p begin="00:54:47.627" end="00:54:51.027" style="s2">That money was for the lawyers. These</p>
<p begin="00:54:49.627" end="00:54:53.927" style="s2">people worked.</p>
<p begin="00:54:51.027" end="00:54:56.127" style="s2">They&#39;re expecting their salaries.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.927" end="00:54:58.127" style="s2">And next month,</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.127" end="00:54:59.327" style="s2">let&#39;s get through this one.</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.127" end="00:55:02.427" style="s2">Some of them are asking whether they</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.327" end="00:55:02.427" style="s2">should look for other jobs.</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.527" end="00:55:05.727" style="s2">Tell them I won&#39;t hold it against them.</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.527" end="00:55:07.728" style="s2">If another company calls for a</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.727" end="00:55:10.328" style="s2">reference, [music] give them good one.</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.728" end="00:55:11.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lose your best people.</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.328" end="00:55:14.993" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They have families.</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.728" end="00:55:17.013" style="s2">They can&#39;t live on my promises.</p>
<p begin="00:55:14.993" end="00:55:17.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.853" end="00:55:24.873" style="s2">[music and singing]</p>
<p begin="00:55:27.828" end="00:55:31.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I try the turn without holding the</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.528" end="00:55:33.228" style="s2">skirt? The fabric moved better during</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.928" end="00:55:36.528" style="s2">the fitting.</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.228" end="00:55:36.528" style="s2">There, hold [music] that.</p>
<p begin="00:55:38.728" end="00:55:41.928" style="s2">The department store campaign has been</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.328" end="00:55:44.128" style="s2">extended. [music] Another fragrance</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.928" end="00:55:46.928" style="s2">company wants a meeting. Do I have time</p>
<p begin="00:55:44.128" end="00:55:49.708" style="s2">to sleep in either contract?</p>
<p begin="00:55:46.928" end="00:55:51.728" style="s2">Thursday, between 11 and 11:10.</p>
<p begin="00:55:49.708" end="00:55:51.728" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.928" end="00:56:05.928" style="s2">You made that look effortless.</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.528" end="00:56:07.928" style="s2">I was counting the steps under my</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.928" end="00:56:09.228" style="s2">breath.</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.928" end="00:56:12.428" style="s2">You can stop now. [music] The newer</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.228" end="00:56:14.828" style="s2">windows, more room, the view you asked</p>
<p begin="00:56:12.428" end="00:56:14.828" style="s2">for.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.228" end="00:56:21.803" style="s2">And somewhere I can cook</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.128" end="00:56:22.728" style="s2">a proper kitchen.</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.803" end="00:56:24.728" style="s2">[music] Good.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.728" end="00:56:27.328" style="s2">I&#39;m tired of opening a menu every time</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.728" end="00:56:27.328" style="s2">I&#39;m hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.328" end="00:56:40.128" style="s2">Good news. [music] He saw the poster.</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.128" end="00:56:42.528" style="s2">Elliot, he used to wait outside my</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.128" end="00:56:43.928" style="s2">lessons, [music] sometimes for hours.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.528" end="00:56:46.928" style="s2">I want him to see that none of that</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.928" end="00:56:46.928" style="s2">waiting was wasted.</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.659" end="00:56:51.989" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.969" end="00:56:51.989" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.028" end="00:56:59.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this your signature</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.128" end="00:57:01.328" style="s2">on the certificate? Yes, we completed</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.028" end="00:57:03.728" style="s2">the work.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.328" end="00:57:07.428" style="s2">They say this attached schedule shows</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.728" end="00:57:07.428" style="s2">you authorized the transfer.</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.228" end="00:57:11.528" style="s2">That That never worked for</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.529" end="00:57:15.529" style="s2">They said it received project money on</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.329" end="00:57:18.629" style="s2">your instructions.</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.529" end="00:57:21.829" style="s2">This page wasn&#39;t attached when I signed.</p>
<p begin="00:57:18.629" end="00:57:21.829" style="s2">Check our submission copy.</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.429" end="00:57:25.829" style="s2">We&#39;ll challenge it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.129" end="00:57:28.429" style="s2">But I need you to stop assuming the</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.829" end="00:57:30.229" style="s2">truth will explain itself.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.429" end="00:57:32.329" style="s2">My clients have stopped answering.</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.229" end="00:57:34.129" style="s2">Nobody asked me anything before printing</p>
<p begin="00:57:32.329" end="00:57:36.029" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="00:57:34.129" end="00:57:37.329" style="s2">Let me deal with the evidence. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.029" end="00:57:39.129" style="s2">give an angry interview. You won&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="00:57:37.329" end="00:57:41.729" style="s2">me take you to dinner. You won&#39;t accept</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.129" end="00:57:43.529" style="s2">a gift. Must every conversation have a</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.729" end="00:57:44.729" style="s2">witness?</p>
<p begin="00:57:43.529" end="00:57:46.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.729" end="00:57:48.629" style="s2">But I thought we understood each other.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.329" end="00:57:52.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the campaign launch.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.629" end="00:57:54.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wardrobe already sent the accessories.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.229" end="00:57:56.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is personal.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.729" end="00:57:59.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I shouldn&#39;t accept it.</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.729" end="00:58:01.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m asking you to reconsider.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.829" end="00:58:03.629" style="s2">I know what we could have together.</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.729" end="00:58:05.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what you want.</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.629" end="00:58:08.529" style="s2">That isn&#39;t the same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.929" end="00:58:10.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he still asking you to wait?</p>
<p begin="00:58:08.529" end="00:58:12.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He hasn&#39;t asked me to wait.</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.329" end="00:58:16.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why am I being turned away for a</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.429" end="00:58:18.829" style="s2">man who won&#39;t even say he wants you?</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.029" end="00:58:22.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I don&#39;t want to marry you.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.829" end="00:58:23.729" style="s2">Even if Elliot never asks me.</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.229" end="00:58:24.929" style="s2">You promised this wouldn&#39;t affect my</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.729" end="00:58:26.329" style="s2">work.</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.929" end="00:58:27.929" style="s2">But I keep coming into meetings</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.329" end="00:58:30.429" style="s2">wondering whether I&#39;ll have to refuse</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.929" end="00:58:30.429" style="s2">you again.</p>
<p begin="00:58:31.829" end="00:58:34.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you needed time.</p>
<p begin="00:58:35.529" end="00:58:39.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been generous professionally. I</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.829" end="00:58:41.229" style="s2">appreciate that.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.429" end="00:58:42.929" style="s2">But every time you remind me what you</p>
<p begin="00:58:41.229" end="00:58:44.329" style="s2">could give me,</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.929" end="00:58:46.429" style="s2">I feel as though you haven&#39;t heard what</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.329" end="00:58:47.829" style="s2">I&#39;m saying.</p>
<p begin="00:58:46.429" end="00:58:48.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard said he couldn&#39;t lend you</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.829" end="00:58:51.729" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.929" end="00:58:53.029" style="s2">Daniel didn&#39;t answer. Leave them.</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.729" end="00:58:55.329" style="s2">They used to answer before the phone</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.029" end="00:58:56.929" style="s2">finished ringing.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.329" end="00:58:59.029" style="s2">They&#39;re afraid of being associated with</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.929" end="00:59:00.429" style="s2">the investigation. But they weren&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.029" end="00:59:01.329" style="s2">afraid of being associated with your</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.429" end="00:59:02.729" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.329" end="00:59:04.929" style="s2">Richard let you pay for his brother&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.729" end="00:59:06.329" style="s2">operation. Today he couldn&#39;t even give</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.929" end="00:59:08.629" style="s2">me 10 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.329" end="00:59:09.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His brother needed the operation.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.629" end="00:59:12.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Must you defend everybody who</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.829" end="00:59:12.529" style="s2">disappoints you?</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.431" end="00:59:20.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call her.</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.831" end="00:59:22.931" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="00:59:20.831" end="00:59:24.531" style="s2">You paid for her future.</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.931" end="00:59:26.931" style="s2">Now you&#39;re selling your car to defend</p>
<p begin="00:59:24.531" end="00:59:26.931" style="s2">your own.</p>
<p begin="00:59:27.231" end="00:59:31.231" style="s2">What I spent on Kukua didn&#39;t create that</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.531" end="00:59:33.031" style="s2">payment schedule.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.231" end="00:59:34.131" style="s2">I know. I am not blaming her for the</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.031" end="00:59:35.731" style="s2">case.</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.131" end="00:59:37.531" style="s2">I am asking why everybody else is</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.731" end="00:59:39.731" style="s2">allowed to know you need help except</p>
<p begin="00:59:37.531" end="00:59:39.731" style="s2">her.</p>
<p begin="00:59:40.231" end="00:59:46.131" style="s2">I won&#39;t turn what I did into a debt.</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.731" end="00:59:46.131" style="s2">We are ready.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.646" end="01:00:00.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:59:58.331" end="01:00:02.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone wanted your photograph tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:00:00.931" end="01:00:04.731" style="s2">Nobody remembered dinner.</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.931" end="01:00:06.231" style="s2">Adrian looked miserable.</p>
<p begin="01:00:04.731" end="01:00:08.231" style="s2">He asked again.</p>
<p begin="01:00:06.231" end="01:00:10.431" style="s2">He&#39;s serious about [music] you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.231" end="01:00:12.531" style="s2">I am serious about my answer.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.431" end="01:00:13.731" style="s2">Then speak to Elliot. You are building</p>
<p begin="01:00:12.531" end="01:00:17.131" style="s2">your whole love life around</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.731" end="01:00:17.131" style="s2">conversations you haven&#39;t had.</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.731" end="01:00:23.501" style="s2">His calls are shorter lately.</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.631" end="01:00:24.631" style="s2">Maybe he&#39;s busy.</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.501" end="01:00:26.931" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.631" end="01:00:28.741" style="s2">We used to talk while he cooked. Now he</p>
<p begin="01:00:26.931" end="01:00:29.831" style="s2">says he&#39;s eating or he has a meeting.</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.741" end="01:00:32.231" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:00:29.831" end="01:00:35.231" style="s2">Something feels different.</p>
<p begin="01:00:32.231" end="01:00:37.331" style="s2">People&#39;s lives change, Kukua.</p>
<p begin="01:00:35.231" end="01:00:39.531" style="s2">Yours has.</p>
<p begin="01:00:37.331" end="01:00:40.731" style="s2">You have a home here, money, work you</p>
<p begin="01:00:39.531" end="01:00:42.831" style="s2">love.</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.731" end="01:00:46.931" style="s2">Don&#39;t make all of it feel empty because</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.831" end="01:00:46.931" style="s2">one man is difficult to understand.</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.531" end="01:00:53.231" style="s2">I am not unhappy with my life.</p>
<p begin="01:00:50.031" end="01:00:53.231" style="s2">I just want him in it.</p>
<p begin="01:01:00.531" end="01:01:04.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sold the house.</p>
<p begin="01:01:02.431" end="01:01:06.931" style="s2">You cleared what you could.</p>
<p begin="01:01:04.331" end="01:01:08.731" style="s2">How much longer can this continue?</p>
<p begin="01:01:06.931" end="01:01:10.131" style="s2">Until they listen.</p>
<p begin="01:01:08.731" end="01:01:11.231" style="s2">That isn&#39;t a plan. Put it in [music] the</p>
<p begin="01:01:10.131" end="01:01:14.031" style="s2">bag.</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.231" end="01:01:14.031" style="s2">It will crease.</p>
<p begin="01:01:16.557" end="01:01:18.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:19.332" end="01:01:23.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My spare room isn&#39;t much. It&#39;s more than</p>
<p begin="01:01:21.632" end="01:01:25.932" style="s2">I have.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.107" end="01:01:27.532" style="s2">[music] You still have me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.932" end="01:01:29.232" style="s2">The first day she came, she asked who</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.532" end="01:01:31.332" style="s2">else would sleep in here.</p>
<p begin="01:01:29.232" end="01:01:34.297" style="s2">She couldn&#39;t believe a whole room could</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.332" end="01:01:34.297" style="s2">be hers. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.132" end="01:01:38.132" style="s2">And now you have a whole room at my</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.532" end="01:01:39.932" style="s2">place. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.132" end="01:01:42.132" style="s2">You just have to manage with a less</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.932" end="01:01:44.132" style="s2">impressive landlord.</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.132" end="01:01:46.032" style="s2">We&#39;re not leaving you behind, Elliot,</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.132" end="01:01:48.052" style="s2">only the house.</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.032" end="01:01:48.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:01:49.932" end="01:01:52.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally. I thought you&#39;d forgotten my</p>
<p begin="01:01:51.832" end="01:01:54.232" style="s2">number.</p>
<p begin="01:01:52.632" end="01:01:55.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.232" end="01:01:59.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you?</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.332" end="01:02:01.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elvis&#39;s place. Just visiting.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.032" end="01:02:04.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look thinner.</p>
<p begin="01:02:01.132" end="01:02:07.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look tired. Have they let you eat?</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.332" end="01:02:08.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t change the subject.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.132" end="01:02:11.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Long week.</p>
<p begin="01:02:08.832" end="01:02:13.632" style="s2">Tell me about yours.</p>
<p begin="01:02:11.432" end="01:02:16.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5 minutes, Kukuwa.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.632" end="01:02:18.932" style="s2">They&#39;ve booked another campaign.</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.032" end="01:02:20.093" style="s2">I wanted to tell you properly.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.932" end="01:02:21.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m listening.</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.093" end="01:02:24.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:02:21.932" end="01:02:25.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, are you coming to see the campaign?</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.032" end="01:02:28.132" style="s2">I can easily make time for you tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:02:25.932" end="01:02:30.032" style="s2">You just have to say the word.</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.132" end="01:02:31.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d love to, Kukuwa, but you need to</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.032" end="01:02:35.432" style="s2">focus on work.</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.532" end="01:02:35.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Back to work it is then.</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.832" end="01:02:41.832" style="s2">Call me tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.432" end="01:02:42.632" style="s2">Not just a message.</p>
<p begin="01:02:41.832" end="01:02:44.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll try.</p>
<p begin="01:02:42.632" end="01:02:45.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Promise?</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.032" end="01:02:47.532" style="s2">I could ask Claire for a few days off,</p>
<p begin="01:02:45.932" end="01:02:48.832" style="s2">come home and see everybody.</p>
<p begin="01:02:47.532" end="01:02:50.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve just said they extended the</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.832" end="01:02:51.832" style="s2">campaign.</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.132" end="01:02:54.332" style="s2">Don&#39;t disrupt it because I&#39;m bad at</p>
<p begin="01:02:51.832" end="01:02:57.432" style="s2">answering calls.</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.332" end="01:03:00.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t be coming because of a phone.</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.432" end="01:03:00.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go. They&#39;re waiting.</p>
<p begin="01:03:01.632" end="01:03:06.532" style="s2">She gave you every chance.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.132" end="01:03:08.932" style="s2">Please, not tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.532" end="01:03:11.032" style="s2">You looked her in the face and lied.</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.932" end="01:03:13.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let the kindness [music] travel far</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.032" end="01:03:13.532" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:03:16.533" end="01:03:20.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; forever [music] in my [singing] head.</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.533" end="01:03:22.433" style="s2">We are</p>
<p begin="01:03:21.833" end="01:03:24.333" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.433" end="01:03:26.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we at least get staff access? They</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.333" end="01:03:27.733" style="s2">have personal things inside.</p>
<p begin="01:03:26.233" end="01:03:29.733" style="s2">I need to reassure my team.</p>
<p begin="01:03:27.733" end="01:03:32.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry, Mr. Mensah. No entry.</p>
<p begin="01:03:29.733" end="01:03:35.233" style="s2">Strictly authorized personnel only.</p>
<p begin="01:03:32.733" end="01:03:38.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I built this from the ground up.</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.233" end="01:03:40.333" style="s2">My staff need their belongings.</p>
<p begin="01:03:38.233" end="01:03:43.133" style="s2">Access has to be arranged through the</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.333" end="01:03:45.333" style="s2">appointed officials.</p>
<p begin="01:03:43.133" end="01:03:48.033" style="s2">I laid the first stone here.</p>
<p begin="01:03:45.333" end="01:03:51.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, they won&#39;t let us collect anything.</p>
<p begin="01:03:48.033" end="01:03:53.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave your number with Elvis.</p>
<p begin="01:03:51.133" end="01:03:55.133" style="s2">We&#39;ll try to arrange it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:53.333" end="01:03:57.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My children keep asking when I&#39;m going</p>
<p begin="01:03:55.133" end="01:03:59.033" style="s2">back to work.</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.033" end="01:04:00.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.033" end="01:04:04.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw me</p>
<p begin="01:04:00.964" end="01:04:05.933" style="s2">[music] before the world could see.</p>
<p begin="01:04:04.233" end="01:04:07.433" style="s2">And when your light grew [singing]</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.933" end="01:04:09.233" style="s2">weaker, you were [music] still</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.433" end="01:04:13.233" style="s2">everything</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.233" end="01:04:15.933" style="s2">to me. I came with dusty feet</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.233" end="01:04:17.133" style="s2">and dreams I couldn&#39;t name.</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.933" end="01:04:18.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot Mensah,</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.133" end="01:04:21.133" style="s2">you&#39;re under arrest in connection with</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.633" end="01:04:23.333" style="s2">the project funds investigation.</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.133" end="01:04:25.533" style="s2">I&#39;m calling his lawyer.</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.333" end="01:04:28.233" style="s2">Put the food away. I&#39;ll eat away. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.533" end="01:04:31.333" style="s2">eat when I return.</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.233" end="01:04:33.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You opened up your door and never asked</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.333" end="01:04:37.233" style="s2">me to change.</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.714" end="01:04:40.233" style="s2">[music] You gave me room to grow</p>
<p begin="01:04:37.233" end="01:04:43.833" style="s2">and watched me learn to fly.</p>
<p begin="01:04:40.233" end="01:04:45.504" style="s2">But hid the fallen pieces when I asked</p>
<p begin="01:04:43.833" end="01:04:45.833" style="s2">if you were fine.</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.504" end="01:04:47.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:45.833" end="01:04:49.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He looked at me and said, I gave the</p>
<p begin="01:04:47.333" end="01:04:51.533" style="s2">instruction.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.233" end="01:04:54.233" style="s2">I challenged his account. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.533" end="01:04:57.333" style="s2">And the original submission?</p>
<p begin="01:04:54.233" end="01:05:00.433" style="s2">We still don&#39;t have the complete file.</p>
<p begin="01:04:57.333" end="01:05:00.433" style="s2">Then how can they decide?</p>
<p begin="01:05:00.733" end="01:05:06.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The court finds the accused guilty.</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.333" end="01:05:09.233" style="s2">You are sentenced to 10 years</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.333" end="01:05:09.233" style="s2">imprisonment.</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.433" end="01:05:12.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ELLIOT!</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.133" end="01:05:14.325" style="s2">I&#39;M HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:05:12.933" end="01:05:15.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALL STRANGERS CALLED MY</p>
<p begin="01:05:14.325" end="01:05:18.933" style="s2">[music and singing] name beneath those</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.833" end="01:05:21.735" style="s2">shining lights.</p>
<p begin="01:05:18.933" end="01:05:24.935" style="s2">You carried all your sorrows through a</p>
<p begin="01:05:21.735" end="01:05:28.535" style="s2">thousand lonely nights.</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.935" end="01:05:29.335" style="s2">I&#39;m still the girl you believed in and I</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.535" end="01:05:31.035" style="s2">believe [music]</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.335" end="01:05:34.635" style="s2">in you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.035" end="01:05:37.835" style="s2">When every door is closed around you.</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.635" end="01:05:39.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t lose that. Sit down.</p>
<p begin="01:05:37.835" end="01:05:41.635" style="s2">I called Richard.</p>
<p begin="01:05:39.735" end="01:05:43.235" style="s2">Daniel too. Everybody has somewhere</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.635" end="01:05:45.135" style="s2">important to be.</p>
<p begin="01:05:43.235" end="01:05:48.435" style="s2">You came.</p>
<p begin="01:05:45.135" end="01:05:48.435" style="s2">That doesn&#39;t make this right.</p>
<p begin="01:05:49.035" end="01:05:53.535" style="s2">I&#39;ve watched men eat at your table for</p>
<p begin="01:05:50.935" end="01:05:56.335" style="s2">years.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.535" end="01:05:59.335" style="s2">Now I&#39;m begging them to return a call.</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.335" end="01:06:02.735" style="s2">And Kukua is on my phone every day.</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.335" end="01:06:04.635" style="s2">A new [music] dress. Another country.</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.735" end="01:06:06.935" style="s2">People opening doors for her while they</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.635" end="01:06:09.335" style="s2">lock yours.</p>
<p begin="01:06:06.935" end="01:06:11.535" style="s2">She doesn&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="01:06:09.335" end="01:06:13.935" style="s2">Then let me tell her.</p>
<p begin="01:06:11.535" end="01:06:18.335" style="s2">I don&#39;t want her feeling</p>
<p begin="01:06:13.935" end="01:06:20.535" style="s2">indebted. Yes. I know.</p>
<p begin="01:06:18.335" end="01:06:22.235" style="s2">What about how I feel? You think I enjoy</p>
<p begin="01:06:20.535" end="01:06:23.735" style="s2">leaving you here?</p>
<p begin="01:06:22.235" end="01:06:25.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:06:23.735" end="01:06:28.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m angry with you. I&#39;m angry with</p>
<p begin="01:06:25.435" end="01:06:31.035" style="s2">everyone and I can&#39;t fix anything.</p>
<p begin="01:06:28.535" end="01:06:33.035" style="s2">On the way here I keep rehearsing good</p>
<p begin="01:06:31.035" end="01:06:35.335" style="s2">news to tell you.</p>
<p begin="01:06:33.035" end="01:06:38.435" style="s2">Something about the lawyers.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.335" end="01:06:38.435" style="s2">Somebody who might help.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.835" end="01:06:43.135" style="s2">Then I get here and all I have is</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.135" end="01:06:45.235" style="s2">another excuse.</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.135" end="01:06:47.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t need to bring news.</p>
<p begin="01:06:45.235" end="01:06:47.735" style="s2">Just come.</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.135" end="01:06:51.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave me a room when I had nowhere to</p>
<p begin="01:06:49.835" end="01:06:54.335" style="s2">sleep.</p>
<p begin="01:06:51.735" end="01:06:56.035" style="s2">Still there.</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.335" end="01:06:58.135" style="s2">But I&#39;m telling her</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.035" end="01:07:00.835" style="s2">you can be angry with me next week.</p>
<p begin="01:06:58.135" end="01:07:03.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will see through.</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.835" end="01:07:06.635" style="s2">You [music] don&#39;t have to earn my love</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.335" end="01:07:09.335" style="s2">and you don&#39;t have to stay.</p>
<p begin="01:07:06.635" end="01:07:10.835" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elliot, you promised I could call even</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.335" end="01:07:14.035" style="s2">if it was late.</p>
<p begin="01:07:10.835" end="01:07:14.035" style="s2">Just tell me you&#39;re all right.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.466" end="01:07:19.486" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:07:20.086" end="01:07:22.106" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="01:07:26.336" end="01:07:29.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kuku.</p>
<p begin="01:07:27.536" end="01:07:32.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean, Sawam?</p>
<p begin="01:07:29.336" end="01:07:34.036" style="s2">Please tell me this is a mistake.</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.636" end="01:07:35.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They convicted him.</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.036" end="01:07:37.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For what?</p>
<p begin="01:07:35.636" end="01:07:39.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The road project money.</p>
<p begin="01:07:37.636" end="01:07:42.836" style="s2">He says the documents were changed. His</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.636" end="01:07:44.236" style="s2">lawyers tried to challenge them.</p>
<p begin="01:07:42.836" end="01:07:46.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is his lawyer now?</p>
<p begin="01:07:44.236" end="01:07:51.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Talking about an appeal.</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.936" end="01:07:54.236" style="s2">Everything needs more work, more money.</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.136" end="01:07:54.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long did they give him?</p>
<p begin="01:07:56.236" end="01:07:58.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 years.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.836" end="01:08:06.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He told me he was visiting you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.136" end="01:08:09.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was living here. He&#39;d sold the house.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.636" end="01:08:12.836" style="s2">The company was falling apart.</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.436" end="01:08:16.836" style="s2">Then they took control of the complex.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.836" end="01:08:16.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And he kept asking whether I had eaten.</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.836" end="01:08:21.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told him to call you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.336" end="01:08:23.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t he?</p>
<p begin="01:08:21.536" end="01:08:25.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He didn&#39;t want you to feel you feel you</p>
<p begin="01:08:23.236" end="01:08:25.736" style="s2">owed him.</p>
<p begin="01:08:26.736" end="01:08:32.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t need to owe him anything.</p>
<p begin="01:08:28.936" end="01:08:32.036" style="s2">I just needed to know.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.836" end="01:08:35.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He still says he doesn&#39;t regret helping</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.636" end="01:08:36.636" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:08:35.136" end="01:08:39.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he eating?</p>
<p begin="01:08:36.636" end="01:08:41.736" style="s2">Is somebody looking after him?</p>
<p begin="01:08:39.336" end="01:08:43.136" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I visit.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.736" end="01:08:45.736" style="s2">But he&#39;s not the man you saw at the</p>
<p begin="01:08:43.136" end="01:08:45.736" style="s2">airport.</p>
<p begin="01:08:46.636" end="01:08:50.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have told me even if he</p>
<p begin="01:08:48.236" end="01:08:54.136" style="s2">begged you not to.</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.636" end="01:08:56.336" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. I should have.</p>
<p begin="01:08:54.136" end="01:08:59.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send me his lawyer&#39;s number.</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.336" end="01:09:00.836" style="s2">Anything you have about the case.</p>
<p begin="01:08:59.436" end="01:09:03.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.836" end="01:09:06.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And please keep visiting him.</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.236" end="01:09:06.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t stopped.</p>
<p begin="01:09:08.162" end="01:09:10.182" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.436" end="01:09:18.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.736" end="01:09:20.136" style="s2">He&#39;s in prison.</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.736" end="01:09:21.736" style="s2">10 years.</p>
<p begin="01:09:20.136" end="01:09:25.136" style="s2">He lost everything, and I was telling</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.736" end="01:09:25.136" style="s2">him about fashion shows.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.136" end="01:09:30.038" style="s2">You couldn&#39;t have known.</p>
<p begin="01:09:28.467" end="01:09:32.038" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:30.038" end="01:09:33.637" style="s2">Where are you going?</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.038" end="01:09:36.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Home.</p>
<p begin="01:09:33.637" end="01:09:39.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please stop. You have contracts. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:36.338" end="01:09:41.338" style="s2">You can hire somebody to help him.</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.137" end="01:09:43.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Somebody is already helping him.</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.338" end="01:09:44.737" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He still needs someone to sit beside</p>
<p begin="01:09:43.038" end="01:09:47.438" style="s2">him. You&#39;re about to interrupt</p>
<p begin="01:09:44.737" end="01:09:49.237" style="s2">everything you worked for.</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.438" end="01:09:50.838" style="s2">When he met me, I was carrying water at</p>
<p begin="01:09:49.237" end="01:09:51.938" style="s2">an engagement.</p>
<p begin="01:09:50.838" end="01:09:54.838" style="s2">He didn&#39;t send someone [music] to tell</p>
<p begin="01:09:51.938" end="01:09:57.438" style="s2">me life would get better. He came. At</p>
<p begin="01:09:54.838" end="01:09:58.938" style="s2">least sleep before deciding.</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.438" end="01:10:01.338" style="s2">I have slept [music] comfortably while</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.938" end="01:10:02.738" style="s2">he&#39;s been suffering.</p>
<p begin="01:10:01.338" end="01:10:05.838" style="s2">I&#39;m not spending another night</p>
<p begin="01:10:02.738" end="01:10:05.838" style="s2">pretending I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="01:10:09.078" end="01:10:12.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.388" end="01:10:12.408" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:10:16.938" end="01:10:20.923" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.903" end="01:10:20.923" style="s2">[singing]</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.338" end="01:10:24.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ghana?</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.137" end="01:10:25.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My friend has been imprisoned. I need to</p>
<p begin="01:10:24.038" end="01:10:26.637" style="s2">see him.</p>
<p begin="01:10:25.038" end="01:10:27.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man you told me about? What</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.637" end="01:10:29.538" style="s2">happened?</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.438" end="01:10:31.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A case involving his company. He says</p>
<p begin="01:10:29.538" end="01:10:34.338" style="s2">the records were changed. I need to</p>
<p begin="01:10:31.238" end="01:10:34.338" style="s2">understand it properly.</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.938" end="01:10:39.238" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re prepared to put all this aside</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.438" end="01:10:41.838" style="s2">for a prisoner?</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.238" end="01:10:44.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His name hasn&#39;t changed.</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.838" end="01:10:47.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t trying to insult him.</p>
<p begin="01:10:44.637" end="01:10:47.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then please use it.</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.938" end="01:10:54.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The next campaign starts soon.</p>
<p begin="01:10:52.338" end="01:10:55.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My manager is reviewing the schedule.</p>
<p begin="01:10:54.338" end="01:10:58.038" style="s2">I&#39;m not disappearing without making</p>
<p begin="01:10:55.838" end="01:11:00.838" style="s2">arrangements.</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.038" end="01:11:03.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And how long will you stay?</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.838" end="01:11:05.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t honestly answer that yet.</p>
<p begin="01:11:03.738" end="01:11:06.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I offered you a life here.</p>
<p begin="01:11:05.538" end="01:11:08.137" style="s2">You couldn&#39;t give me an answer beyond</p>
<p begin="01:11:06.938" end="01:11:10.338" style="s2">no.</p>
<p begin="01:11:08.137" end="01:11:13.038" style="s2">But for him, you&#39;re ready to leave.</p>
<p begin="01:11:10.338" end="01:11:16.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not doing this to hurt you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:13.038" end="01:11:16.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then help me understand.</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.238" end="01:11:20.038" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He taught me without making me feel</p>
<p begin="01:11:18.637" end="01:11:21.838" style="s2">foolish.</p>
<p begin="01:11:20.038" end="01:11:23.637" style="s2">Paid for my education without asking me</p>
<p begin="01:11:21.838" end="01:11:25.338" style="s2">to belong to him.</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.637" end="01:11:27.137" style="s2">When I finally earned something, he told</p>
<p begin="01:11:25.338" end="01:11:29.239" style="s2">me control of it.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.137" end="01:11:33.239" style="s2">I won&#39;t use the life he helped me build</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.239" end="01:11:35.139" style="s2">as my excuse for abandoning him.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.239" end="01:11:37.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Coordinate with your manager.</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.139" end="01:11:39.039" style="s2">We&#39;ll arrange the leave.</p>
<p begin="01:11:37.139" end="01:11:40.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.039" end="01:11:43.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Have a safe journey. You&#39;ll hear from</p>
<p begin="01:11:40.939" end="01:11:43.139" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.839" end="01:11:53.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The scheduled posts will continue. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:11:51.539" end="01:11:55.839" style="s2">handle the campaign questions.</p>
<p begin="01:11:53.739" end="01:11:57.139" style="s2">Nothing about him. [music] Not until I</p>
<p begin="01:11:55.839" end="01:11:58.439" style="s2">understand what happened.</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.139" end="01:12:00.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.439" end="01:12:02.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still think you&#39;re taking on too much.</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.539" end="01:12:05.439" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to agree. Just don&#39;t ask</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.339" end="01:12:05.439" style="s2">me to leave him there alone.</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.979" end="01:12:09.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.139" end="01:12:12.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love</p>
<p begin="01:12:09.239" end="01:12:14.139" style="s2">you through the pain you&#39;d never say.</p>
<p begin="01:12:12.839" end="01:12:16.439" style="s2">Don&#39;t tell me I [music] should leave</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.139" end="01:12:18.839" style="s2">because your world [singing] has come</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.439" end="01:12:21.139" style="s2">apart.</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.839" end="01:12:24.739" style="s2">You never needed [music] riches to have</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.139" end="01:12:24.739" style="s2">room inside my heart.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.839" end="01:12:28.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it really you?</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.939" end="01:12:29.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve landed. Can you meet me?</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.539" end="01:12:30.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Landed where?</p>
<p begin="01:12:29.739" end="01:12:32.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Accra.</p>
<p begin="01:12:30.839" end="01:12:33.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came?</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.739" end="01:12:36.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="01:12:33.939" end="01:12:39.639" style="s2">I don&#39;t want to stand here crying.</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.839" end="01:12:42.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m still the girl you believed [music]</p>
<p begin="01:12:39.639" end="01:12:46.039" style="s2">in and I believe in you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:42.939" end="01:12:49.739" style="s2">And every door closed around you, my</p>
<p begin="01:12:46.039" end="01:12:49.739" style="s2">heart [music] will see through.</p>
<p begin="01:12:53.439" end="01:12:58.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for telling me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:55.739" end="01:12:58.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have done it sooner.</p>
<p begin="01:13:03.739" end="01:13:06.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you drive for me while I handle the</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.439" end="01:13:07.139" style="s2">calls?</p>
<p begin="01:13:06.339" end="01:13:08.839" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.139" end="01:13:10.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll agree on a salary.</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.839" end="01:13:12.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t asking for that.</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.539" end="01:13:13.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. But helping me will take your</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.739" end="01:13:16.639" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.739" end="01:13:19.939" style="s2">You looked after him when I couldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.639" end="01:13:19.939" style="s2">Let me make this part easier.</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.939" end="01:13:26.239" style="s2">How different does he look?</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.339" end="01:13:27.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s lost weight.</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.239" end="01:13:29.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not all you&#39;re trying to tell me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.739" end="01:13:31.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just remember he&#39;s still the man you</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.139" end="01:13:31.439" style="s2">know.</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.539" end="01:13:33.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam,</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.440" end="01:13:35.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is it true you&#39;ve returned from America</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.940" end="01:13:38.240" style="s2">because of a convicted businessman? He</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.740" end="01:13:39.440" style="s2">is a person, not just a headline.</p>
<p begin="01:13:38.240" end="01:13:40.940" style="s2">Why risk your reputation getting</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.440" end="01:13:43.740" style="s2">involved? When the whole world saw</p>
<p begin="01:13:40.940" end="01:13:45.240" style="s2">nothing in me, he saw everything.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.740" end="01:13:47.851" style="s2">I cannot enjoy the life he helped me</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.240" end="01:13:49.871" style="s2">build while he suffers alone.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.851" end="01:13:49.871" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.340" end="01:14:00.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it really you?</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.740" end="01:14:00.440" style="s2">My God, is that really you?</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.940" end="01:14:03.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my dear.</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.226" end="01:14:06.246" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.466" end="01:14:12.796" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.776" end="01:14:12.796" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.640" end="01:14:19.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You traveled all that way.</p>
<p begin="01:14:15.940" end="01:14:19.440" style="s2">Have you eaten? What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.740" end="01:14:24.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re still asking me that?</p>
<p begin="01:14:22.540" end="01:14:26.496" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought at the next hearing</p>
<p begin="01:14:24.240" end="01:14:27.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And when that didn&#39;t help</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.496" end="01:14:30.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:27.240" end="01:14:30.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I waited for the next one.</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.040" end="01:14:35.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You let me learn everything slowly.</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.440" end="01:14:37.440" style="s2">Why couldn&#39;t you let me learn how to be</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.940" end="01:14:40.740" style="s2">there for you?</p>
<p begin="01:14:37.440" end="01:14:42.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t know how to tell you I wasn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.740" end="01:14:43.740" style="s2">I didn&#39;t want you looking at everything</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.240" end="01:14:44.940" style="s2">I&#39;d done for you and feeling you had to</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.740" end="01:14:47.140" style="s2">repay it.</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.940" end="01:14:50.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t have to ask for money.</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.140" end="01:14:50.540" style="s2">You could have told me you were afraid.</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.007" end="01:14:57.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:14:55.140" end="01:14:59.246" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about your work?</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.240" end="01:14:59.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Arranged.</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.246" end="01:15:00.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.740" end="01:15:02.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please listen.</p>
<p begin="01:15:00.840" end="01:15:04.487" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.740" end="01:15:06.340" style="s2">Let somebody else carry something for a</p>
<p begin="01:15:04.487" end="01:15:08.140" style="s2">[music] change. I won&#39;t pretend I</p>
<p begin="01:15:06.340" end="01:15:10.440" style="s2">understand the case yet,</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.140" end="01:15:12.540" style="s2">but I&#39;m going to find people who do.</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.440" end="01:15:14.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t authorize that payment.</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.540" end="01:15:16.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then start there. [music] Tell me</p>
<p begin="01:15:14.340" end="01:15:16.940" style="s2">everything.</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.340" end="01:15:24.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you all right?</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.440" end="01:15:27.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.340" end="01:15:27.640" style="s2">But I need to be useful.</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.142" end="01:15:36.142" style="s2">&gt;&gt; on [music and singing] me. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.942" end="01:15:39.042" style="s2">have to carry it all.</p>
<p begin="01:15:36.142" end="01:15:41.942" style="s2">With these empty hands,</p>
<p begin="01:15:39.042" end="01:15:44.842" style="s2">what can I give to you? [music]</p>
<p begin="01:15:41.942" end="01:15:46.742" style="s2">Your heart, your honest words, a life</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.842" end="01:15:48.742" style="s2">where we both tell the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.742" end="01:15:51.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; conviction depends heavily on this</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.742" end="01:15:53.742" style="s2">payment schedule and the accountant&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.042" end="01:15:53.742" style="s2">testimony.</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.342" end="01:15:59.042" style="s2">He says that page wasn&#39;t attached when</p>
<p begin="01:15:56.342" end="01:15:59.042" style="s2">he signed.</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.542" end="01:16:06.542" style="s2">Then we need to establish what he</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.442" end="01:16:06.542" style="s2">actually signed.</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.942" end="01:16:14.142" style="s2">His former lawyer requested the original</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.942" end="01:16:17.342" style="s2">submission, but the complete record</p>
<p begin="01:16:14.142" end="01:16:17.342" style="s2">never reached the hearing.</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.042" end="01:16:20.842" style="s2">Can you appeal?</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.242" end="01:16:30.142" style="s2">There are grounds worth pursuing.</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.242" end="01:16:33.342" style="s2">I&#39;ll need the full case file before</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.142" end="01:16:33.342" style="s2">advising you further.</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.842" end="01:16:37.642" style="s2">Tell me what you need. People,</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.542" end="01:16:40.242" style="s2">documents, travel, I&#39;ll provide the</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.642" end="01:16:41.442" style="s2">resources. I can promise you serious</p>
<p begin="01:16:40.242" end="01:16:44.642" style="s2">work,</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.442" end="01:16:48.442" style="s2">not a particular judgment.</p>
<p begin="01:16:44.642" end="01:16:50.142" style="s2">I&#39;m not asking you to buy his freedom.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.442" end="01:16:52.242" style="s2">I&#39;m asking you to find what nobody could</p>
<p begin="01:16:50.142" end="01:16:54.242" style="s2">get before they took it. Can you locate</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.242" end="01:16:55.242" style="s2">his former project staff?</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.242" end="01:16:57.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll start today.</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.242" end="01:17:00.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. We&#39;ll also examine an application</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.942" end="01:17:03.698" style="s2">for bail while the appeal proceeds.</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.942" end="01:17:05.718" style="s2">Then please begin.</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.698" end="01:17:05.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:17:10.248" end="01:17:13.442" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.842" end="01:17:15.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was still at that office when I left</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.442" end="01:17:17.442" style="s2">last night.</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.042" end="01:17:19.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell her to rest.</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.442" end="01:17:21.242" style="s2">You can tell her yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.742" end="01:17:23.742" style="s2">She listens to me only when I say the</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.242" end="01:17:25.842" style="s2">car is ready.</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.742" end="01:17:28.142" style="s2">She&#39;s paying me properly. Insisted on</p>
<p begin="01:17:25.842" end="01:17:28.142" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:28.842" end="01:17:32.742" style="s2">I mocked her, my friend,</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.542" end="01:17:36.242" style="s2">in the village, in your house. Even when</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.742" end="01:17:36.242" style="s2">you were here, I was angry at her.</p>
<p begin="01:17:36.943" end="01:17:40.643" style="s2">You were frightened.</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.413" end="01:17:42.043" style="s2">[music] That doesn&#39;t make it fair.</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.643" end="01:17:44.643" style="s2">You believed in somebody I wouldn&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="01:17:42.043" end="01:17:44.643" style="s2">have noticed.</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.143" end="01:17:50.443" style="s2">Now she&#39;s the one fighting for you. I&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.943" end="01:17:52.143" style="s2">never been so relieved to be wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:17:50.443" end="01:17:54.743" style="s2">I just want to go home. We haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:17:52.143" end="01:17:54.743" style="s2">stopped trying.</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.788" end="01:17:56.808" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:18:00.143" end="01:18:03.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s declined another appearance. She</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.143" end="01:18:06.743" style="s2">wants to remain in Ghana.</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.843" end="01:18:09.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The campaign is still performing.</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.743" end="01:18:12.243" style="s2">Her manager has handled the schedule.</p>
<p begin="01:18:09.443" end="01:18:13.943" style="s2">I thought she would stay a few days.</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.243" end="01:18:16.243" style="s2">I kept asking why she wouldn&#39;t choose</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.943" end="01:18:17.643" style="s2">the life I offered.</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.243" end="01:18:20.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She told us she didn&#39;t know how long it</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.643" end="01:18:21.943" style="s2">would take.</p>
<p begin="01:18:20.143" end="01:18:25.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perhaps she already had something she</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.943" end="01:18:26.843" style="s2">didn&#39;t want to lose.</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.043" end="01:18:28.243" style="s2">Contact her manager. Find out what</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.843" end="01:18:29.143" style="s2">support she actually wants.</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.243" end="01:18:31.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Publicly?</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.143" end="01:18:33.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No publicity and nothing that obliges</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.343" end="01:18:35.043" style="s2">her to come back before she&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.443" end="01:18:37.343" style="s2">Prepare for a visit when the time is</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.043" end="01:18:37.343" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.543" end="01:18:42.243" style="s2">We&#39;ve benefited from her work. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.743" end="01:18:44.043" style="s2">want our concern to end with a message.</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.243" end="01:18:47.343" style="s2">There is no obligation here and this</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.043" end="01:18:47.343" style="s2">remains entirely private.</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.704" end="01:18:57.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.843" end="01:19:04.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Questions continue to grow over the</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.543" end="01:19:06.443" style="s2">imprisonment of business mogul Elliot</p>
<p begin="01:19:04.943" end="01:19:08.143" style="s2">with critics calling it political</p>
<p begin="01:19:06.443" end="01:19:10.043" style="s2">persecution.</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.143" end="01:19:11.743" style="s2">Opposition voices allege the new</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.043" end="01:19:14.043" style="s2">government is using his arrest to</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.743" end="01:19:16.743" style="s2">distract Ghanaians from scandals and</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.043" end="01:19:18.643" style="s2">broken campaign promises. His supporters</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.743" end="01:19:21.543" style="s2">insist that the truth behind his</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.643" end="01:19:23.943" style="s2">conviction has yet to emerge.</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.543" end="01:19:26.843" style="s2">Meanwhile, international fashion model</p>
<p begin="01:19:23.943" end="01:19:31.443" style="s2">Kukua has returned to Ghana, determined</p>
<p begin="01:19:26.843" end="01:19:33.695" style="s2">to fight for Elliot and demand justice.</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.443" end="01:19:34.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This girl has become a serious problem.</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.695" end="01:19:35.843" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.443" end="01:19:38.243" style="s2">How did she find out what we&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.843" end="01:19:38.243" style="s2">planning?</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.943" end="01:19:41.744" style="s2">Foreign journalists [music] are already</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.244" end="01:19:43.244" style="s2">watching.</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.744" end="01:19:46.244" style="s2">If the documents come out, the whole</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.244" end="01:19:48.445" style="s2">government could face a scandal.</p>
<p begin="01:19:46.244" end="01:19:51.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She says she will not rest until the</p>
<p begin="01:19:48.445" end="01:19:51.744" style="s2">truth is revealed.</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.344" end="01:19:57.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We underestimated her.</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.445" end="01:19:59.844" style="s2">If she knows about our arrangement,</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.144" end="01:20:01.744" style="s2">then we&#39;re all in trouble.</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.844" end="01:20:04.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kukuwa Asate&#39;s legal team is now</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.744" end="01:20:05.644" style="s2">demanding answers as international</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.045" end="01:20:08.744" style="s2">observers begin questioning the</p>
<p begin="01:20:05.644" end="01:20:11.144" style="s2">government&#39;s handling of the case.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.744" end="01:20:12.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. Turn this thing off. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.144" end="01:20:14.744" style="s2">want to hear another word about that</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.445" end="01:20:14.744" style="s2">girl.</p>
<p begin="01:20:15.615" end="01:20:17.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.045" end="01:20:29.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is not the final [music] decision on</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.744" end="01:20:31.445" style="s2">his conviction.</p>
<p begin="01:20:29.844" end="01:20:33.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand.</p>
<p begin="01:20:31.445" end="01:20:36.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bail is granted pending determination of</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.644" end="01:20:38.344" style="s2">the appeal subject to the conditions set</p>
<p begin="01:20:36.045" end="01:20:38.344" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:20:39.445" end="01:20:44.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The application is hereby granted.</p>
<p begin="01:20:42.144" end="01:20:48.144" style="s2">Elliot Mensah is granted bail pending</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.545" end="01:20:48.144" style="s2">the determination of his appeal.</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.296" end="01:20:54.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.744" end="01:21:00.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally.</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.644" end="01:21:00.744" style="s2">Finally, you are back, my brother.</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.776" end="01:21:06.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.144" end="01:21:08.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re coming with us.</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.744" end="01:21:10.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard.</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.344" end="01:21:10.945" style="s2">Say it.</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.291" end="01:21:15.144" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.144" end="01:21:15.144" style="s2">I&#39;m coming with you.</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.081" end="01:21:25.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music and singing]</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.144" end="01:21:34.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. [music] You&#39;re already paying me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:31.744" end="01:21:34.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is separate.</p>
<p begin="01:21:35.945" end="01:21:42.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are things I said about you.</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.945" end="01:21:42.244" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember some of them.</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.745" end="01:21:46.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should hear the rest [music] before</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.946" end="01:21:46.845" style="s2">you give me anything.</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.046" end="01:21:52.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave him somewhere to sleep, you</p>
<p begin="01:21:49.646" end="01:21:53.866" style="s2">visited him, you contacted me.</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.845" end="01:21:55.146" style="s2">We can talk about what hurt another</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.866" end="01:21:59.146" style="s2">[music] day,</p>
<p begin="01:21:55.146" end="01:21:59.146" style="s2">but first let&#39;s finish this case.</p>
<p begin="01:22:00.416" end="01:22:02.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:03.446" end="01:22:05.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My brother, thank you for not giving up</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.146" end="01:22:08.046" style="s2">on me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.946" end="01:22:08.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never. I was with you then and I&#39;m with</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.046" end="01:22:11.546" style="s2">you now.</p>
<p begin="01:22:08.546" end="01:22:13.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You carried me when I had nothing left.</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.546" end="01:22:15.946" style="s2">You rented all this?</p>
<p begin="01:22:13.146" end="01:22:18.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, I bought it for you. The documents</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.946" end="01:22:18.646" style="s2">are with the lawyer.</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.946" end="01:22:24.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really shouldn&#39;t have.</p>
<p begin="01:22:20.546" end="01:22:24.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t finish that. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.646" end="01:22:32.446" style="s2">I wanted you to have somewhere to</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.946" end="01:22:34.046" style="s2">recover, [music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:32.446" end="01:22:36.245" style="s2">somewhere nobody has to make room for</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.046" end="01:22:36.245" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:22:39.946" end="01:22:43.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know how to receive this.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.245" end="01:22:46.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave me a room when everything I</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.745" end="01:22:49.845" style="s2">owned fitted into [music] one bag.</p>
<p begin="01:22:46.046" end="01:22:49.845" style="s2">Let me do this without making it a debt.</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.782" end="01:22:58.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.046" end="01:22:59.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kept it after everything you went</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.446" end="01:23:01.646" style="s2">through?</p>
<p begin="01:22:59.745" end="01:23:04.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I asked them not to lose [music] it.</p>
<p begin="01:23:01.646" end="01:23:04.845" style="s2">It was all I had left of you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.812" end="01:23:13.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.646" end="01:23:23.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We located the former site engineer. He</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.745" end="01:23:24.046" style="s2">kept the submission email and its</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.245" end="01:23:24.646" style="s2">original attachment.</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.046" end="01:23:26.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; file?</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.646" end="01:23:29.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The version sent from your office. It</p>
<p begin="01:23:26.646" end="01:23:31.046" style="s2">contains the completion certificate,</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.146" end="01:23:33.546" style="s2">but not the not the disputed payment</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.046" end="01:23:33.546" style="s2">schedule.</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.048" end="01:23:38.068" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.245" end="01:23:50.347" style="s2">The document my client signed certified</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.347" end="01:23:52.247" style="s2">completed work.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.347" end="01:23:54.747" style="s2">The additional payment schedule was not</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.247" end="01:23:56.547" style="s2">part of that submission.</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.747" end="01:24:00.147" style="s2">The records now before this panel</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.547" end="01:24:00.147" style="s2">established that distinction.</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.547" end="01:24:05.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m afraid to hope.</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.647" end="01:24:07.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then just hold my hand.</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.747" end="01:24:09.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The evidence relied upon to establish</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.847" end="01:24:11.947" style="s2">the appellant&#39;s authorization of the</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.647" end="01:24:14.647" style="s2">disputed payment cannot safely support</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.947" end="01:24:16.647" style="s2">the appellant is acquitted.</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.647" end="01:24:20.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it over?</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.647" end="01:24:22.553" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over. You&#39;re free.</p>
<p begin="01:24:20.047" end="01:24:25.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dreams I couldn&#39;t name.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.553" end="01:24:28.947" style="s2">[music] You opened up your door. You</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.347" end="01:24:32.647" style="s2">never asked me to change.</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.947" end="01:24:35.347" style="s2">You gave me room to grow.</p>
<p begin="01:24:32.647" end="01:24:36.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you, God. Oh my God, thank you so</p>
<p begin="01:24:35.347" end="01:24:38.547" style="s2">much.</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.947" end="01:24:40.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My brother,</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.547" end="01:24:43.847" style="s2">you&#39;re finally free.</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.847" end="01:24:46.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Mensah, what kept you going?</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.847" end="01:24:48.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Faith, family, and knowing that justice</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.347" end="01:24:51.547" style="s2">would eventually prevail.</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.147" end="01:24:51.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s something I need to ask you.</p>
<p begin="01:24:52.347" end="01:24:54.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here?</p>
<p begin="01:24:58.547" end="01:25:03.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, Elliot,</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.547" end="01:25:03.447" style="s2">let me finish</p>
<p begin="01:25:04.347" end="01:25:10.424" style="s2">before you find another reason to</p>
<p begin="01:25:06.247" end="01:25:10.424" style="s2">protect me from my own feelings. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:25:11.047" end="01:25:15.947" style="s2">When I left Ghana,</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.747" end="01:25:19.747" style="s2">I kept looking back because I thought</p>
<p begin="01:25:15.947" end="01:25:23.347" style="s2">you would ask me to stay in your life,</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.747" end="01:25:23.347" style="s2">not stop me traveling.</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.547" end="01:25:28.347" style="s2">Just tell me there was a place for me</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.447" end="01:25:31.147" style="s2">beside you.</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.347" end="01:25:35.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave me the freedom to choose.</p>
<p begin="01:25:31.147" end="01:25:36.569" style="s2">This is my choice. Will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.259" end="01:25:38.589" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [applause]</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.569" end="01:25:38.589" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.464" end="01:25:44.484" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.247" end="01:25:50.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally. We nearly needed another lawyer</p>
<p begin="01:25:49.549" end="01:25:52.289" style="s2">for that answer.</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.979" end="01:25:54.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.289" end="01:25:54.309" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:26:09.049" end="01:26:13.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I used to stand here and think this was</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.149" end="01:26:14.549" style="s2">the proof that I&#39;d succeeded.</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.249" end="01:26:16.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now?</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.549" end="01:26:17.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I know what makes it worth opening.</p>
<p begin="01:26:16.849" end="01:26:19.948" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.149" end="01:26:19.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank [music] you too.</p>
<p begin="01:26:20.249" end="01:26:24.149" style="s2">You look rested</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.948" end="01:26:27.749" style="s2">for the first time in months.</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.149" end="01:26:27.749" style="s2">This is the man I told you about.</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.049" end="01:26:31.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s good to meet you under better</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.249" end="01:26:32.948" style="s2">circumstances.</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.049" end="01:26:35.149" style="s2">Thank you for coming.</p>
<p begin="01:26:32.948" end="01:26:36.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome to Ghana. I&#39;m their friend.</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.149" end="01:26:38.795" style="s2">We&#39;ve heard about you too. Only the</p>
<p begin="01:26:36.849" end="01:26:40.815" style="s2">recent reports, I hope.</p>
<p begin="01:26:38.795" end="01:26:40.815" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.349" end="01:26:45.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The board has approved a $20 million</p>
<p begin="01:26:43.149" end="01:26:46.948" style="s2">performance award recognizing your</p>
<p begin="01:26:45.448" end="01:26:48.049" style="s2">contribution to North Star&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:26:46.948" end="01:26:49.948" style="s2">international growth.</p>
<p begin="01:26:48.049" end="01:26:52.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 20 million?</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.948" end="01:26:53.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this tied to a new agreement?</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.049" end="01:26:54.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.049" end="01:26:57.749" style="s2">Any future contract will be discussed</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.948" end="01:27:01.549" style="s2">separately through your representatives.</p>
<p begin="01:26:57.749" end="01:27:01.549" style="s2">This recognizes the work already done.</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.349" end="01:27:06.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know what to say.</p>
<p begin="01:27:05.049" end="01:27:08.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The founder asked that you read this</p>
<p begin="01:27:06.948" end="01:27:09.649" style="s2">privately.</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.049" end="01:27:11.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dear Kukua,</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.649" end="01:27:14.149" style="s2">I spent too long believing that offering</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.849" end="01:27:15.749" style="s2">more would change your [music] answer.</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.149" end="01:27:17.649" style="s2">You were clear with me.</p>
<p begin="01:27:15.749" end="01:27:19.448" style="s2">I should have listened sooner.</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.649" end="01:27:21.249" style="s2">Watching you [music] stand beside Elliot</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.448" end="01:27:24.249" style="s2">helped me understand something I had</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.249" end="01:27:25.955" style="s2">failed to respect. Loyalty is not a</p>
<p begin="01:27:24.249" end="01:27:27.349" style="s2">competition that the wealthiest person</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.955" end="01:27:29.049" style="s2">[music] wins.</p>
<p begin="01:27:27.349" end="01:27:31.749" style="s2">The board&#39;s award recognizes your</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.049" end="01:27:33.160" style="s2">professional contribution. You earned it</p>
<p begin="01:27:31.749" end="01:27:35.249" style="s2">through your work.</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.160" end="01:27:37.849" style="s2">[music] This letter is personal.</p>
<p begin="01:27:35.249" end="01:27:40.149" style="s2">Congratulations to you and Elliot. I</p>
<p begin="01:27:37.849" end="01:27:42.049" style="s2">wish you a peaceful life together.</p>
<p begin="01:27:40.149" end="01:27:43.749" style="s2">Whenever you are ready to discuss future</p>
<p begin="01:27:42.049" end="01:27:45.849" style="s2">work, you will be [music] welcomed as</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.749" end="01:27:46.749" style="s2">the professional partner you have always</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.849" end="01:27:50.150" style="s2">been.</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.749" end="01:27:52.750" style="s2">With respect, Adrian Whitmore.</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.150" end="01:27:52.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May [music] I read it?</p>
<p begin="01:27:58.051" end="01:28:00.071" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.650" end="01:28:05.250" style="s2">He offered you all that and I was</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.650" end="01:28:06.550" style="s2">sitting [music] in a cell.</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.250" end="01:28:07.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t compare yourselves like</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.550" end="01:28:08.650" style="s2">that.</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.350" end="01:28:10.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just keep thinking</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.650" end="01:28:11.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; that you should understand why I chose</p>
<p begin="01:28:10.150" end="01:28:12.550" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:11.250" end="01:28:15.081" style="s2">Then ask me.</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.550" end="01:28:15.650" style="s2">Don&#39;t decide my answer for me again.</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.081" end="01:28:16.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.650" end="01:28:18.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why me?</p>
<p begin="01:28:16.950" end="01:28:20.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I miss you when you&#39;re in the</p>
<p begin="01:28:18.150" end="01:28:22.550" style="s2">next room. Because I want to tell you</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.250" end="01:28:25.250" style="s2">ordinary things, not only the good news.</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.550" end="01:28:26.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more hiding the bad news.</p>
<p begin="01:28:25.250" end="01:28:28.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even when you think you&#39;re protecting</p>
<p begin="01:28:26.650" end="01:28:30.950" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:28:28.550" end="01:28:33.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Especially then.</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.950" end="01:28:37.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And watch me learn [singing] to fly</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.950" end="01:28:38.650" style="s2">but hear the falling pieces when I asked</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.550" end="01:28:40.350" style="s2">if you</p>
<p begin="01:28:38.650" end="01:28:42.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your manager will contact you about the</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.350" end="01:28:44.350" style="s2">next schedule.</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.250" end="01:28:47.150" style="s2">Tell her we&#39;ll talk after the wedding</p>
<p begin="01:28:44.350" end="01:28:48.750" style="s2">arrangements.</p>
<p begin="01:28:47.150" end="01:28:50.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember.</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.750" end="01:28:52.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:28:50.950" end="01:28:55.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I love you.</p>
<p begin="01:28:52.250" end="01:28:55.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Much better.</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.450" end="01:29:05.350" style="s2">I used to carry water through here.</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.350" end="01:29:09.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Does it still flood?</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.350" end="01:29:09.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama says some cars turn back.</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.650" end="01:29:19.550" style="s2">Let me look at you,</p>
<p begin="01:29:16.750" end="01:29:19.550" style="s2">my son.</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.150" end="01:29:26.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry I frightened everybody.</p>
<p begin="01:29:22.850" end="01:29:28.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t apologize for being hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.250" end="01:29:29.950" style="s2">You can manage a company,</p>
<p begin="01:29:28.250" end="01:29:32.850" style="s2">but apparently you cannot tell your</p>
<p begin="01:29:29.950" end="01:29:34.650" style="s2">mother you need her.</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.850" end="01:29:36.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, Mama.</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.650" end="01:29:38.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more.</p>
<p begin="01:29:36.350" end="01:29:38.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more.</p>
<p begin="01:29:39.750" end="01:29:43.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wish he could have met you.</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.250" end="01:29:45.750" style="s2">He would have liked the man who let you</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.850" end="01:29:48.450" style="s2">finish speaking. He&#39;s still learning</p>
<p begin="01:29:45.750" end="01:29:48.450" style="s2">that part.</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.850" end="01:29:53.451" style="s2">Our friends are here. Our lives are</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.151" end="01:29:55.751" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="01:29:53.451" end="01:29:57.251" style="s2">Then we won&#39;t take you away.</p>
<p begin="01:29:55.751" end="01:29:59.351" style="s2">We&#39;ll build here.</p>
<p begin="01:29:57.251" end="01:30:01.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Build what?</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.351" end="01:30:03.351" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Homes you can enjoy</p>
<p begin="01:30:01.451" end="01:30:05.751" style="s2">without worrying about the next rainy</p>
<p begin="01:30:03.351" end="01:30:05.751" style="s2">season.</p>
<p begin="01:30:06.432" end="01:30:08.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.751" end="01:30:13.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My daughter, I asked for a stronger</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.851" end="01:30:15.351" style="s2">roof.</p>
<p begin="01:30:13.951" end="01:30:17.651" style="s2">It has one.</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.351" end="01:30:20.651" style="s2">And all the rest, somewhere for you to</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.651" end="01:30:20.651" style="s2">enjoy being home.</p>
<p begin="01:30:21.451" end="01:30:26.351" style="s2">You two have been keeping secrets again.</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.351" end="01:30:27.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the curtains. You approved</p>
<p begin="01:30:26.351" end="01:30:29.412" style="s2">everything else.</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.392" end="01:30:29.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:30:29.552" end="01:30:33.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You remembered.</p>
<p begin="01:30:31.351" end="01:30:36.151" style="s2">He belongs here too.</p>
<p begin="01:30:33.751" end="01:30:39.751" style="s2">Mama, there&#39;s room for visitors. You</p>
<p begin="01:30:36.151" end="01:30:39.751" style="s2">don&#39;t have to give up your bed anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:30:39.837" end="01:30:44.251" style="s2">[laughter] My friend, tomorrow morning,</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.552" end="01:30:46.387" style="s2">tea at mine.</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.251" end="01:30:48.407" style="s2">Only if you come here for lunch.</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.387" end="01:30:48.407" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:30:49.662" end="01:30:51.682" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.213" end="01:30:58.233" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.951" end="01:31:06.651" style="s2">This section needs more drainage before</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.851" end="01:31:08.552" style="s2">we continue.</p>
<p begin="01:31:06.651" end="01:31:10.151" style="s2">Then we finish the drainage.</p>
<p begin="01:31:08.552" end="01:31:13.451" style="s2">We&#39;re not building something that looks</p>
<p begin="01:31:10.151" end="01:31:13.451" style="s2">good for one photograph.</p>
<p begin="01:31:14.552" end="01:31:18.538" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.518" end="01:31:18.538" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.378" end="01:31:27.052" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.751" end="01:31:28.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have remembered where you came from.</p>
<p begin="01:31:27.052" end="01:31:30.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This village raised me before my partner</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.851" end="01:31:32.451" style="s2">ever met me. Some of you fed us when we</p>
<p begin="01:31:30.851" end="01:31:34.151" style="s2">had very little.</p>
<p begin="01:31:32.451" end="01:31:36.823" style="s2">Some gave me work.</p>
<p begin="01:31:34.151" end="01:31:38.552" style="s2">We wanted to leave something useful.</p>
<p begin="01:31:36.823" end="01:31:41.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:31:38.552" end="01:31:44.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The woman who once asked who built Accra</p>
<p begin="01:31:41.052" end="01:31:46.052" style="s2">is now asking engineers about drainage.</p>
<p begin="01:31:44.151" end="01:31:46.648" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be careful. I&#39;m checking your reports</p>
<p begin="01:31:46.052" end="01:31:48.668" style="s2">next.</p>
<p begin="01:31:46.648" end="01:31:48.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:31:51.888" end="01:31:53.908" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:32:00.752" end="01:32:04.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You survived the case, the proposal, and</p>
<p begin="01:32:03.052" end="01:32:06.052" style="s2">the mothers. Please don&#39;t forget your</p>
<p begin="01:32:04.852" end="01:32:08.552" style="s2">vows.</p>
<p begin="01:32:06.052" end="01:32:08.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:32:09.752" end="01:32:14.852" style="s2">I promise to tell you the truth before</p>
<p begin="01:32:11.352" end="01:32:16.653" style="s2">silence becomes distance.</p>
<p begin="01:32:14.852" end="01:32:19.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I promise to [music] stand beside you</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.653" end="01:32:22.352" style="s2">without forgetting who I am and to let</p>
<p begin="01:32:19.052" end="01:32:22.352" style="s2">you stand beside me too.</p>
<p begin="01:32:27.259" end="01:32:29.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:32:29.879" end="01:32:31.899" style="s2">[applause]</p>
<p begin="01:32:35.774" end="01:32:37.794" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:32:39.552" end="01:32:43.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Site inspection at 10</p>
<p begin="01:32:41.653" end="01:32:45.599" style="s2">design meeting at 12</p>
<p begin="01:32:43.752" end="01:32:46.452" style="s2">your husband has requested lunch.</p>
<p begin="01:32:45.599" end="01:32:48.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.452" end="01:32:51.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has he made an appointment?</p>
<p begin="01:32:48.952" end="01:32:52.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I brought supporting documents.</p>
<p begin="01:32:51.852" end="01:32:55.352" style="s2">I&#39;ll give the applicant some [music]</p>
<p begin="01:32:52.852" end="01:32:55.352" style="s2">privacy.</p>
<p begin="01:32:57.552" end="01:33:03.452" style="s2">The plans for my house are ready.</p>
<p begin="01:33:00.052" end="01:33:03.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll review them together.</p>
<p begin="01:33:05.904" end="01:33:09.234" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [singing]</p>
<p begin="01:33:07.214" end="01:33:09.234" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:33:13.764" end="01:33:15.752" style="s2">[crying and laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:33:14.552" end="01:33:17.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s laughing at you.</p>
<p begin="01:33:15.752" end="01:33:20.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s appreciating my effort.</p>
<p begin="01:33:17.852" end="01:33:20.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:33:20.252" end="01:33:23.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:33:21.852" end="01:33:24.452" style="s2">I used to imagine coming home from</p>
<p begin="01:33:23.252" end="01:33:25.653" style="s2">prison</p>
<p begin="01:33:24.452" end="01:33:26.852" style="s2">the gate</p>
<p begin="01:33:25.653" end="01:33:29.952" style="s2">the car.</p>
<p begin="01:33:26.852" end="01:33:33.052" style="s2">I never imagined this.</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.952" end="01:33:33.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s enjoy it.</p>
<p begin="01:33:36.034" end="01:33:38.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.252" end="01:33:42.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My brothers and sisters, not everyone is</p>
<p begin="01:33:41.552" end="01:33:44.952" style="s2">ungrateful.</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.752" end="01:33:46.153" style="s2">Some people will disappoint you.</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.952" end="01:33:48.653" style="s2">Some will forget what you [music] did</p>
<p begin="01:33:46.153" end="01:33:50.653" style="s2">for them. That pain is real.</p>
<p begin="01:33:48.653" end="01:33:52.952" style="s2">But don&#39;t allow one person&#39;s behavior to</p>
<p begin="01:33:50.653" end="01:33:54.552" style="s2">become your judgment of everybody.</p>
<p begin="01:33:52.952" end="01:33:55.653" style="s2">When you help someone</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.552" end="01:33:57.153" style="s2">don&#39;t make their [music] life the</p>
<p begin="01:33:55.653" end="01:33:59.454" style="s2">payment.</p>
<p begin="01:33:57.153" end="01:34:01.554" style="s2">Don&#39;t demand their love, their silence,</p>
<p begin="01:33:59.454" end="01:34:03.545" style="s2">or their obedience.</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.554" end="01:34:04.654" style="s2">Give them room to become themselves.</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.545" end="01:34:06.854" style="s2">[music] And when you are the one</p>
<p begin="01:34:04.654" end="01:34:09.154" style="s2">struggling,</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.854" end="01:34:11.354" style="s2">I thought hiding my pain was protecting</p>
<p begin="01:34:09.154" end="01:34:13.254" style="s2">the people I loved.</p>
<p begin="01:34:11.354" end="01:34:15.854" style="s2">Instead, [music] I kept them outside</p>
<p begin="01:34:13.254" end="01:34:17.354" style="s2">when I needed them beside me.</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.854" end="01:34:19.954" style="s2">Kindness does not guarantee that</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.354" end="01:34:21.754" style="s2">everything will be returned to you.</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.954" end="01:34:25.054" style="s2">Help with wisdom. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:34:21.754" end="01:34:26.554" style="s2">Protect yourself where you must.</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.054" end="01:34:27.754" style="s2">But leave room in your heart for good</p>
<p begin="01:34:26.554" end="01:34:29.354" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.754" end="01:34:30.854" style="s2">They still exist.</p>
<p begin="01:34:29.354" end="01:34:32.454" style="s2">May you find [music] genuine support in</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.854" end="01:34:35.154" style="s2">your difficult days.</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.454" end="01:34:36.554" style="s2">May someone answer when you call.</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.154" end="01:34:39.454" style="s2">And may you also become a person [music]</p>
<p begin="01:34:36.554" end="01:34:40.654" style="s2">who answers for somebody else.</p>
<p begin="01:34:39.454" end="01:34:42.754" style="s2">Amen.</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.654" end="01:34:44.654" style="s2">If you share that prayer, you may type</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.754" end="01:34:47.254" style="s2">amen in the comments. [music] Until we</p>
<p begin="01:34:44.654" end="01:34:49.395" style="s2">meet again, be kind</p>
<p begin="01:34:47.254" end="01:34:51.415" style="s2">and let yourself be loved too.</p>
<p begin="01:34:49.395" end="01:34:51.415" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:34:53.980" end="01:34:56.000" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="01:34:58.565" end="01:35:01.554" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.354" end="01:35:03.805" style="s2">Kukua, remember this is before your life</p>
<p begin="01:35:01.554" end="01:35:05.254" style="s2">changes. Keep everything natural.</p>
<p begin="01:35:03.805" end="01:35:08.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:35:05.254" end="01:35:08.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, director. I&#39;m ready.</p>
<p begin="01:35:09.354" end="01:35:14.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, look directly into her eyes.</p>
<p begin="01:35:11.754" end="01:35:16.250" style="s2">Make it feel natural. With Kukua, that</p>
<p begin="01:35:14.454" end="01:35:16.906" style="s2">shouldn&#39;t be difficult.</p>
<p begin="01:35:16.250" end="01:35:18.054" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:35:16.906" end="01:35:19.454" style="s2">[gasps] All right, let&#39;s get ready for</p>
<p begin="01:35:18.054" end="01:35:21.954" style="s2">filming.</p>
<p begin="01:35:19.454" end="01:35:23.754" style="s2">Kukua, remember you&#39;ve never seen this</p>
<p begin="01:35:21.954" end="01:35:26.075" style="s2">kind of house before.</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.754" end="01:35:28.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; EVERYTHING MUST SURPRISE YOU.</p>
<p begin="01:35:26.075" end="01:35:28.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:35:29.354" end="01:35:35.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ELLIOT, YOU&#39;VE LOST ALMOST EVERYTHING.</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.254" end="01:35:39.854" style="s2">That tie is one thing you cannot let go.</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.901" end="01:35:39.854" style="s2">[sighs] Camera rolling. Action.</p>
<p begin="01:35:40.354" end="01:35:44.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please like, subscribe, [music] comment,</p>
<p begin="01:35:42.654" end="01:35:45.654" style="s2">and share.</p>
<p begin="01:35:44.154" end="01:35:47.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And let us know where you are watching</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.654" end="01:35:50.966" style="s2">from.</p>
<p begin="01:35:47.254" end="01:35:52.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you SO MUCH FOR WATCHING.</p>
<p begin="01:35:50.966" end="01:35:52.986" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cheering]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
